      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.abyss_curse": "Curse of the Abyss",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.abyss_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the Abyss: §fEvery fishing catch has a level-scaling chance to pull up a hostile §cDrowned§f or §cGuardian§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.adaptive_shell": "Adaptive Shell",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.adaptive_shell.desc": "§7• §eAdaptive Shell: §fRepeated hits from the same damage type progressively reduce that damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.adrenaline": "Adrenaline",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.adrenaline.desc": "§7• §eAdrenaline: §fBelow 40% health, grants emergency Speed and Resistance.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.advanced_sharpness": "Advanced Sharpness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.advanced_sharpness.desc": "§7• §eAdvanced Sharpness: §fAdds §c+3§f flat damage and §c+8%§f bonus melee damage per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.aerodynamic": "Aerodynamic",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.aerodynamic.desc": "§7• §eAerodynamic: §fWhile gliding, reduces drag and preserves more speed per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.air_brake": "Air Brake",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.air_brake.desc": "§7• §eAir Brake: §fSneaking while gliding quickly reduces horizontal and vertical speed.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.amphibious": "Amphibious",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.amphibious.desc": "§7• §eAmphibious: §fGrants Water Breathing and Dolphin's Grace while swimming.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.anchoring": "Anchoring",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.anchoring.desc": "§7• §eAnchoring: §fSneaking reduces horizontal speed but increases knockback resistance.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.anglers_blessing": "Angler's Blessing",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.anglers_blessing.desc": "§7• §eAngler's Blessing: §fGrants a §a12%§f chance per level to double edible fish caught while restoring hunger and granting §aLuck I§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.annihilating_sweep": "Annihilating Sweep",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.annihilating_sweep.desc": "§7• §eAnnihilating Sweep: §fCharged melee swings unleash a wide shockwave dealing §c100%§f of your full damage to all nearby enemies.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.armor_damage": "Armor Damage",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.armor_damage.desc": "§7• §cArmor Damage: §fEvery hit taken inflicts steady extra durability wear on your armor.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.armor_pry": "Armor Pry",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.armor_pry.desc": "§7• §eArmor Pry: §f+15% damage per level against armored targets.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.armor_shatter": "Armor Shatter",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.armor_shatter.desc": "§7• §cArmor Shatter: §fIncoming hits have a chance to violently crack 8% of your armor's max durability at once.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.army_summon": "Army Summon",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.army_summon.desc": "§7• §eArmy Summon: §fRight-clicking spends a small amount of XP to call a loyal patrol that fights alongside you.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.assimilation": "Assimilation",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.assimilation.desc": "§7• §eAssimilation: §fAutomatically eats food from inventory when hungry.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.barbed_hook": "Barbed Hook",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.barbed_hook.desc": "§7• §eBarbed Hook: §fReeling a hooked living target deals 2 + 2.25 damage per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bash_damage": "Bash Damage",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bash_damage.desc": "§7• §eBash Damage: §fEvery frontal shield block deals 3 reflected damage per level to the attacker.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bash_power": "Bash Power",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bash_power.desc": "§7• §eBash Power: §fBlocking a frontal attack forcefully slams the attacker back and briefly stuns them.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.basic_chrono_mending": "Basic Chrono Mending",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.basic_chrono_mending.desc": "§7• §eBasic Chrono Mending: §fAutomatically restores §a0.5%§f of max durability every §e6 seconds§f without consuming XP.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.basic_leap_power": "Basic Leap Power",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.basic_leap_power.desc": "§7• §eBasic Leap Power: §fContinuously grants §aJump Boost§f scaling with enchantment level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.basic_lightness": "Basic Lightness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.basic_lightness.desc": "§7• §eBasic Lightness: §fNoticeably slows your descent through the air and softens landing damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.basic_mending": "Basic Mending",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.basic_mending.desc": "§7• §eBasic Mending: §fGradually repairs this item whenever you collect XP orbs (§a+1§f durability per XP per level).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.basic_swiftness": "Basic Swiftness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.basic_swiftness.desc": "§7• §eBasic Swiftness: §fIncreases your movement speed by §b+3%§f per level while sprinting.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bastion_heart": "Bastion Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bastion_heart.desc": "§7• §eBastion Heart: §fNear a wall, reduces incoming damage by 8% per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.battle_hardened": "Battle Hardened",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.battle_hardened.desc": "§7• §eBattle Hardened: §fIncreases weapon damage by §c+1%§f for every §e1%§f of durability missing on the item.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.battle_scarred": "Battle-Scarred",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.battle_scarred.desc": "§7• §cBattle-Scarred: §fGradually reduces weapon damage as the item loses durability.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.beheading": "Beheading",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.beheading.desc": "§7• §eBeheading: §fFully charged strikes deal +20% damage to wounded foes (<50% HP); slaying a target grants Strength and Speed for 4s.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.berserk": "Berserk",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.berserk.desc": "§7• §eBerserk: §fIncreases melee damage in proportion to your missing health.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.big_step": "Big Step",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.big_step.desc": "§7• §eBig Step: §fAutomatically steps up §a1 to 3 full blocks§f (based on level) simply by walking forward.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.big_stomach": "Big Stomach",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.big_stomach.desc": "§7• §eBig Stomach: §fGrants a §a25%§f chance to absorb over half of an incoming blow and knock the attacker sharply back.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blaze_battle": "Blaze Battle",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blaze_battle.desc": "§7• §eBlaze Battle: §fWhile you are on fire, your melee attacks deal §6+20%§f bonus damage per level and ignite the target.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blaze_repulsion_heart": "Blaze Repulsion Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blaze_repulsion_heart.desc": "§7• §eBlaze Repulsion Heart: §fReflects melee damage back at attackers and sets them ablaze on contact.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blaze_sanctuary": "Blaze Sanctuary",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blaze_sanctuary.desc": "§7• §eBlaze Sanctuary: §fReduces direct fire and burning damage by 80%.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blaze_walker": "Blaze Walker",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blaze_walker.desc": "§7• §eBlaze Walker: §fGrants Fire Resistance and solidifies lava directly beneath your steps into Obsidian.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blazing_arrow": "Blazing Arrow",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blazing_arrow.desc": "§7• §eBlazing Arrow: §fSets living creatures within roughly 6 blocks of the arrow impact on fire for 4 seconds.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blazing_rage": "Blazing Rage",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blazing_rage.desc": "§7• §eBlazing Rage: §fWhile burning, grants §6+12%§f melee damage, sprint speed, and Haste per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blazing_soul_sweep": "Blazing Soul Sweep",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blazing_soul_sweep.desc": "§7• §eBlazing Soul Sweep: §fSweeping attacks unleash blue soul-flames dealing magic damage and §8Wither§f to nearby enemies.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blazing_trauma": "Blazing Trauma",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blazing_trauma.desc": "§7• §eBlazing Trauma: §fMelee hits set the target on fire and inflict brief §7Weakness§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.block": "Block",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.block.desc": "§7• §eBlock: §fGrants a §a12% + 10%§f chance per level (up to §a45%§f) to completely block an incoming attack.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.blood_drinker_edge": "Blood-Drinker's Edge",
