      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bounce.desc": "§7• §eBounce: §fArrows physically bounce off blocks, walls and floors up to 1 + level times.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bouncy": "Bouncy",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bouncy.desc": "§7• §eBouncy: §fBounces you upward on every landing just like landing on a Slime Block while negating fall damage (hold Sneak to stick the landing without bouncing).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bountiful_harvest": "Bountiful Harvest",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bountiful_harvest.desc": "§7• §eBountiful Harvest: §fBreaking a mature wheat, carrot or potato crop drops one extra produce item per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.breath_heal": "Breath Heal",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.breath_heal.desc": "§7• §eBreath Heal: §fAt full air, heals 2 HP every 2 seconds.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.breath_holding": "Breath Holding",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.breath_holding.desc": "§7• §eBreath Holding: §fYour air supply constantly refills underwater.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.briar_arrow": "Briar Arrow",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.briar_arrow.desc": "§7• §eBriar Arrow: §fOn block impact, temporarily grows Sweet Berry Bushes across nearby grass blocks.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.brimstone": "Brimstone",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.brimstone.desc": "§7• §eBrimstone: §fTriggers a sulfurous blast on impact that ignites nearby enemies and inflicts §8Wither§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.brittle_knees": "Curse of Brittle Knees",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.brittle_knees.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Brittle Knees: §fEvery jump damages the leggings and briefly applies Slowness based on level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.brittle_wings_curse": "Curse of Brittle Wings",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.brittle_wings_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Brittle Wings: §fConsumes 1 + level elytra durability every second of flight.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.brutal": "Brutal",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.brutal.desc": "§7• §eBrutal: §fAdds §c+2.2§f damage per level (at §7-5%§f attack speed) and forcefully knocks targets back on charged swings.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.buoy": "Buoy",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.buoy.desc": "§7• §eBuoy: §fPropels you swiftly toward the water surface based on level (hold Sneak to dive freely).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.burning_heart": "Burning Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.burning_heart.desc": "§7• §eBurning Heart: §fTaking a hit ignites you for §65s§f per level, immediately activating your fire-based gear bonuses.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.burrowing": "Burrowing",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.burrowing.desc": "§7• §eBurrowing: §fBores a 1x2 directional tunnel ahead through soil or stone and grants underground Night Vision.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.burst_step": "Combat Lunge",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.burst_step.desc": "§7• §eCombat Lunge: §fLanding or taking a hit propels you forward and grants §bSpeed II§f for §e2.5s§f (2–3s cooldown).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.campfire_heal": "Campfire Heal",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.campfire_heal.desc": "§7• §eCampfire Heal: §fPassively restores §a1 HP§f (0.5 heart) per level every second.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.carriers_stride": "Carrier's Stride",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.carriers_stride.desc": "§7• §eCarrier's Stride: §fIncreases your movement speed while using an item such as a raised shield, drawn bow, or food.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.cavalier": "Cavalier",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.cavalier.desc": "§7• §eCavalier: §fDeals +50% damage per level only while riding a living mount.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.cave_in_curse": "Curse of Cave-In",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.cave_in_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Cave-In: §fMining natural stone may create Gravel overhead and apply Mining Fatigue.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.chain_lightning": "Chain Lightning",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.chain_lightning.desc": "§7• §eChain Lightning: §fIn rain, impacts arc chain lightning across §b2, 3, or 5§f nearby monsters based on level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.chaos": "Chaos",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.chaos.desc": "§7• §eChaos: §fAt impact, creates a 3.5-block cloud that applies one random negative effect for 2 seconds to each target once.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.chest_tightness": "Chest Tightness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.chest_tightness.desc": "§7• §cChest Tightness: §fTaking damage has a chance to afflict you with temporary §cWeakness§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.chimeras_whim": "Chimera's Whim",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.chimeras_whim.desc": "§7• §eChimera's Whim: §fEvery jump triggers a random effect drawn from your active §dElemental Heart§f enchantments (boots only).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.chrono_mending": "Chrono Mending",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.chrono_mending.desc": "§7• §eChrono Mending: §fAutomatically restores §a1.5%§f of max durability per level every §e3 seconds§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.cloud_stride": "Cloud Stride",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.cloud_stride.desc": "§7• §eCloud Stride: §fAt high altitude (Y ≥ 160), weaves a temporary cloud-wreathed barrier trail beneath your feet that automatically vanishes 4 blocks behind you, leaving nothing in the world.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.cloud_walker": "Cloud Walker",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.cloud_walker.desc": "§7• §eCloud Walker: §fConjures a cloud cushion beneath your feet on every jump, granting a boosted mid-air Triple Jump (§ax2§f / §ex3.5§f / §6x5§f jump height & distance across Lvl I–III) and completely negating fall damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.combat_roll": "Combat Roll",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.combat_roll.desc": "§7• §eCombat Roll: §fFalling while moving forward automatically triggers a forward roll that sharply reduces fall damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.combo_slash": "Combo Slash",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.combo_slash.desc": "§7• §eCombo Slash: §fLanding consecutive hits within §e0.5s§f stacks §c+20%§f bonus damage per strike (up to §c+600%§f).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.commander": "Commander",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.commander.desc": "§7• §eCommander: §fChanges Summon Army into a mixed force of wolves and Iron Golems.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.composting": "Composting",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.composting.desc": "§7• §eComposting: §fBreaking a plant has a chance per level to produce Bone Meal.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.concentration": "Concentration",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.concentration.desc": "§7• §eConcentration: §fStanding still charges projectile accuracy and up to 60% additional projectile damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.conduit_heart": "Conduit Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.conduit_heart.desc": "§7• §eConduit Heart: §fGrants Conduit Power while in water or rain.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.cooked_catch": "Cooked Catch",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.cooked_catch.desc": "§7• §eCooked Catch: §fCod and salmon catches also provide their cooked version.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.core_harvesting": "Core Harvesting",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.core_harvesting.desc": "§7• §eCore Harvesting: §fLets you mine and collect §dBedrock§f, §eMonster Spawners§f, and §bEnd Portal Frames§f with left-click.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.corpulent": "Corpulent",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.corpulent.desc": "§7• §eCorpulent: §fAdds §b+2 Armor§f, knockback resistance, §a-25%§f explosion damage, and out-of-combat §6Absorption§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.crash_landing": "Crash Landing",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.crash_landing.desc": "§7• §cCrash Landing: §fSlams you heavily into the ground, multiplying fall damage taken by §c2.4x§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.crippled": "Crippled",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.crippled.desc": "§7• §cCrippled: §fRemoves §c1 Armor§f and §c4%§f movement speed per level, and slows you briefly when hit.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.crit_rate": "Crit Rate",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.crit_rate.desc": "§7• §eCrit Rate: §fGrants §a+10%§f chance per level to land a critical hit even while grounded (§a100%§f at level X).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.critical_strike": "Dive Strike",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.critical_strike.desc": "§7• §eDive Strike: §fFalling melee attacks gain §c+22%§f bonus damage per level scaling with fall height and release an impact shockwave.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.curse_of_tremor": "Curse of Tremor",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.curse_of_tremor.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Tremor: §fYour grip betrays you: 15% chance to drop your weapon on strike.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.curse_of_whispers": "Curse of Whispers",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.curse_of_whispers.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Whispers: §fEvery 10 to 150 seconds, plays 1 to 3 random hostile-mob sounds, sometimes overlapping like a fake nearby pack.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.cursed_blade": "Cursed Blade",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.cursed_blade.desc": "§7• §cCursed Blade: §fMultiplies your weapon damage by §c10x§f, but taking even §c1§f point of damage instantly drops you to 0 HP.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.damage_critical": "Meteoric Slam",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.damage_critical.desc": "§7• §eMeteoric Slam: §fAerial slam attacks gain §c+35%§f damage per level scaling with fall height and crush nearby foes with a shockwave.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.dash": "Dash",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.dash.desc": "§7• §eDash: §fStarting a sprint launches a swift forward dash with brief incoming projectile evasion.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.decapitation": "Decapitation",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.decapitation.desc": "§7• §eDecapitation: §fEach kill has a 12% chance per level (up to 60%) to sever and drop the victim's skull.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.deep_hypoxia": "Deep Hypoxia",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.deep_hypoxia.desc": "§7• §eDeep Hypoxia: §fYou take 30% less damage in the depths (below y=20).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.delay": "Delay",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.delay.desc": "§7• §eDelay: §fPlants a ticking temporal charge on impact that detonates after 1.5s without breaking blocks.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.delicate_extraction": "Delicate Extraction",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.delicate_extraction.desc": "§7• §eDelicate Extraction: §fGives a 15% chance per level to additionally drop the mined block itself.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.depth_curse": "Curse of the Depths",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.depth_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the Depths: §fHolding the cursed trident underwater drags you downward and reduces air.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.desperate_kill": "Desperate Kill",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.desperate_kill.desc": "§7• §eDesperate Kill: §fAdds 0.5 damage per missing HP per level; below 30% health, also multiplies damage by +30% per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.devour": "Devour",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.devour.desc": "§7• §eDevour: §fEvery creature slain restores health, hunger, and saturation scaling with level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.diamond_glow_gauntlet": "Diamond Glow Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.diamond_glow_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eDiamond Glow Gauntlet: §fWhile empty-handed, your punches shatter up to §b16 connected§f stone blocks in a luminous flash.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.dimensional_step": "Dimensional Step",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.dimensional_step.desc": "§7• §eDimensional Step: §fIn the Overworld adds movement speed, in the Nether grants Fire Resistance, and in the End slows falling.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.disarm": "Disarm",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.disarm.desc": "§7• §eDisarm: §fGrants a chance to force a struck monster to drop its held weapon.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.divine_protection": "Divine Protection",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.divine_protection.desc": "§7• §eDivine Protection: §fReduces all incoming damage by 10% per total level across your armor, capped at 90%.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.dragons_breath_arrow": "Dragon's Breath Arrow",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.dragons_breath_arrow.desc": "§7• §eDragon's Breath Arrow: §fArrows leave a lingering breath cloud.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.dread_aura": "Dread Aura",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.dread_aura.desc": "§7• §eDread Aura: §fWeakens, pushes back, and disrupts the aggro of non-boss monsters around you.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.dredge": "Abyssal Dredge",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.dredge.desc": "§7• §eAbyssal Dredge: §fGrants a §b15%§f chance per level to haul up sunken minerals, prismarine, emeralds, or nautilus shells when fishing.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.dry_arrow": "Dry Arrow",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.dry_arrow.desc": "§7• §eDry Arrow: §fOn block impact, dries a §e4-block§f sphere: clears water and plants, parches grass into coarse dirt, and cools magma into obsidian.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.e_speed": "Electric Speed",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.e_speed.desc": "§7• §eElectric Speed: §fBoosts your sprinting speed by §b+8%§f per level in a crackle of electric sparks.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.earth_bound": "Earth Bound",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.earth_bound.desc": "§7• §cEarth Bound: §fPulls you downward much faster while airborne under heavy gravity.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.earth_heart": "Earth Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.earth_heart.desc": "§7• §eEarth Heart: §fGrants §a+%s§f elemental heart(s) (regenerated underground), reduces incoming damage, adds block chance, and speeds up mining.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.echo_strike": "Echo Strike",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.echo_strike.desc": "§7• §eEcho Strike: §fAfter 0.5 seconds, repeats 25% to 45% of the hit damage based on level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.echolocation": "Echolocation",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.echolocation.desc": "§7• §eEcholocation: §fIn darkness (light < 8), periodically emits a sonar pulse that highlights nearby creatures with Glowing.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.elastic_soles": "Spring-Coil Soles",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.elastic_soles.desc": "§7• §eSpring-Coil Soles: §fHold Sneak on the ground (0.4s) then jump to launch a high spring-coil vault; also cushions fall damage by 25%/lvl without forced bouncing.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.electric_heart": "Electric Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.electric_heart.desc": "§7• §eElectric Heart: §fGrants §b+%s§f elemental heart(s) (regenerated in thunderstorms) and gives melee hits a chance to shock, slow, or highlight foes.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.elemental_chain": "Elemental Chain",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.elemental_chain.desc": "§7• §eElemental Chain: §fAdapts arrows to your environment: ignites in the Nether, slows in rain or water, and inflicts Levitation in the End.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ember_core": "Ember Core",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ember_core.desc": "§7• §eEmber Core: §fWhen you are hit, grants a §640%§f chance to set your attacker on fire (helmet only).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ember_step": "Ember Step",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ember_step.desc": "§7• §eEmber Step: §fWhile sprinting, leaves a short-lived trail of fire.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.empty_fist_gauntlet": "Empty Fist Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.empty_fist_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eEmpty Fist Gauntlet: §fEmpty-handed punches deal §c+50%§f bonus damage per level against armored enemies.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.end_corrosion": "End Corrosion",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.end_corrosion.desc": "§7• §cEnd Corrosion: §fInside the End's void, this item gradually disintegrates over time.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.end_curse": "Curse of the End",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.end_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the End: §fReduces weapon damage by §c60%§f in the End, but increases it by §a+30%§f in all other dimensions.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ender_hook": "Ender Hook",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ender_hook.desc": "§7• §eEnder Hook: §fReeling a hook embedded in a safe block teleports you to it, with hunger cost and cooldown.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.enemy_attractor": "Enemy Attractor",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.enemy_attractor.desc": "§7• §eEnemy Attractor: §fStruck enemies become the target of nearby mobs.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.enemy_speed_pursuit": "Enemy's Pursuit",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.enemy_speed_pursuit.desc": "§7• §cEnemy's Pursuit: §fWhile sprinting, grants §cSpeed III§f for 3s to all monsters within 8 blocks.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.eternal": "Eternal",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.eternal.desc": "§7• §eEternal: §fPrevents the item from ever breaking at 0 durability, slowly repairs wear, and keeps it on death.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.evasive_footwork": "Evasive Footwork",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.evasive_footwork.desc": "§7• §eEvasive Footwork: §fWhile not sprinting, lateral movement relative to your view direction grants Speed based on enchantment level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.execute_chance": "Guillotine",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.execute_chance.desc": "§7• §eGuillotine: §fAgainst wounded foes (< 35% HP), each sword strike has a 7% chance per level to instantly execute them.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.execute_power": "Reaper's Scythe",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.execute_power.desc": "§7• §eReaper's Scythe: §fWith a hoe: executes monsters below §c10% + 5%/lvl§f HP (heavy bonus damage vs bosses), heals §a2 HP/lvl§f, and grants Haste II.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.exercise": "Exercise",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.exercise.desc": "§7• §eExercise: §fSustained sprinting restores saturation, grants §bSpeed§f, and maintains a protective §6Absorption§f heart.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.exhaustion": "Exhaustion",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.exhaustion.desc": "§7• §cExhaustion: §fWhen exhausted or low on stamina, your melee attacks deal §c50%§f less damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.experience_harvest": "Experience Harvest",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.experience_harvest.desc": "§7• §eExperience Harvest: §fKills create an additional experience orb worth 5 XP per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.experienced_fishing": "Experienced Fishing",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.experienced_fishing.desc": "§7• §eExperienced Fishing: §fIncreases experience gained from every successful fishing catch by §a+37.5%§f per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.explosion_protection": "Explosion Guard",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.explosion_protection.desc": "§7• §eExplosion Guard: §fReduces explosion damage by 20% per level, down to zero.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.explosive_return": "Explosive Return",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.explosive_return.desc": "§7• §eExplosive Return: §fWhen the trident returns near its owner it creates a knockback wave.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.extension": "Extension",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.extension.desc": "§7• §eExtension: §f+1 damage, +0.35 entity reach and +0.5 block reach per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.extracting": "Extracting",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.extracting.desc": "§7• §eExtracting: §fExtracts bonus raw ore or gems and multiplies ore XP without breaking adjacent blocks.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.extreme_sharpness": "Extreme Sharpness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.extreme_sharpness.desc": "§7• §eExtreme Sharpness: §fAdds §c+5§f flat damage and §c+12%§f bonus melee damage per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.false_bite_curse": "Curse of False Bite",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.false_bite_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of False Bite: §f12% chance per level that a normal-looking bite yields no loot.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.farmers_hoe": "Farmer's Hoe",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.farmers_hoe.desc": "§7• §eFarmer's Hoe: §fHarvests only fully mature crops around you and automatically replants broken mature crops.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fast_eating": "Fast Eating",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fast_eating.desc": "§7• §eFast Eating: §fGreatly speeds up eating food and drinking potions based on level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fear": "Fear",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fear.desc": "§7• §cFear: §fIn darkness or underground, reduces your damage by §c25%§f (§c30%§f against bosses) and slows mining speed.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fiery_sweep": "Fiery Sweep",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fiery_sweep.desc": "§7• §eFiery Sweep: §fSweeping attacks unleash a wide arc of embers igniting nearby foes for §66s§f with bonus fire damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.final_breath": "Second Wind",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.final_breath.desc": "§7• §eSecond Wind: §fDropping below §e25%§f HP cleanses Poison and Wither and grants §64 + 2/lvl§f Absorption HP plus Resistance II (45s cooldown).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fire_devour": "Fire Devour",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fire_devour.desc": "§7• §eFire Devour: §fWhenever you catch fire, immediately extinguishes the flames and restores §a1 hunger point§f per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fire_heart": "Fire Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fire_heart.desc": "§7• §eFire Heart: §fGrants §6+%s§f elemental heart(s) (regenerated near fire or lava); losing a heart triggers a safe knockback blast without breaking blocks.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fire_protection_enhancement": "Fire Protection Enhancement",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fire_protection_enhancement.desc": "§7• §eFire Protection Enhancement: §fReduces fire damage by 12% per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fire_shell": "Fire Shell",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fire_shell.desc": "§7• §eFire Shell: §fWhile burning, you take 25% less damage per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fishing_grapple": "Grappling Hook",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fishing_grapple.desc": "§7• §eGrappling Hook: §fReeling a hook embedded in a block pulls you toward it with increased range and force per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.flint_heart": "Flint Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.flint_heart.desc": "§7• §eFlint Heart: §fAdds §c+2.5§f piercing arrow damage per level at the cost of slight extra bow wear.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.flint_strike": "Flint Strike",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.flint_strike.desc": "§7• §eFlint Strike: §fStrikes ignite the target (3s per level).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.focused_ambush": "Focused Ambush",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.focused_ambush.desc": "§7• §eFocused Ambush: §f+20% damage per level against full-health targets.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.focused_crit": "Focused Crit",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.focused_crit.desc": "§7• §eFocused Crit: §fCritical hits trigger while sneaking.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.focused_punch_gauntlet": "Focused Punch Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.focused_punch_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eFocused Punch Gauntlet: §fUnarmed hits while sneaking deal triple damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.focused_steadiness": "Focused Steadiness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.focused_steadiness.desc": "§7• §eFocused Steadiness: §fGrants Resistance while sneaking; higher levels increase its amplifier.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.food_is_heaven": "Food Is Heaven",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.food_is_heaven.desc": "§7• §eFood Is Heaven: §fYou cannot be damaged while eating or drinking a potion.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.food_power_strike": "Food Power Strike",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.food_power_strike.desc": "§7• §eFood Power Strike: §fIncreases your melee damage in proportion to how full your hunger bar is.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.foot_placement": "Air Walk",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.foot_placement.desc": "§7• §eAir Walk: §fCreates a temporary invisible barrier trail wreathed in soft clouds beneath your feet so you can walk through mid-air; barriers automatically vanish once 4 blocks behind you (sneak to descend).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.foresight": "Foresight",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.foresight.desc": "§7• §eForesight: §fAfter 10 seconds without taking damage, reduces the next incoming hit by 20% per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fracture": "Fracture",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.fracture.desc": "§7• §cFracture: §fFalls may fracture your legs, leaving you slowed and weakened.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.frost_trail": "Frost Trail",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.frost_trail.desc": "§7• §eFrost Trail: §fTemporarily turns water beneath your steps into Frosted Ice.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.gale": "Ascending Gale",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.gale.desc": "§7• §eAscending Gale: §fPressing Sneak mid-air unleashes an updraft launching you skyward and resetting fall distance (once per jump).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.gale_step": "Gale Step",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.gale_step.desc": "§7• §eGale Step: §fPassively increases jump height by §b+10%§f per level and cushions landing damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.general": "General",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.general.desc": "§7• §eGeneral: §fGrants §6Strength§f and §eHaste§f to you, plus §6Strength§f and §bSpeed§f to nearby allies and summoned troops.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.giant_slayer": "Giant Slayer",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.giant_slayer.desc": "§7• §eGiant Slayer: §fDeals §c+25%§f bonus damage per level against large creatures or foes with at least §e40 max HP§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.giant_step": "Giant Step",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.giant_step.desc": "§7• §eGiant Step: §fSteps straight up tall walls simply by walking forward (§a4 to 18 blocks§f based on level) with zero fall damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.glass_bones_champion_curse": "Curse of the Glass-Boned Champion",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.glass_bones_champion_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the Glass-Boned Champion: §fWhile worn, increases all damage dealt by 25% per level, but also all damage taken by 25% per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.gluttony": "Gluttony",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.gluttony.desc": "§7• §eGluttony: §fEating grants Regeneration and Absorption; while stuffed (hunger >=16), you take 12% less damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.grapple": "Grapple",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.grapple.desc": "§7• §eGrapple: §fPropels the shooter toward the impact like a grappling hook (or pulls a struck target toward you while sneaking).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ground_skimmer": "Ground Skimmer",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ground_skimmer.desc": "§7• §eGround Skimmer: §fFlying near solid ground preserves additional speed per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.guard_breaker": "Guard Breaker",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.guard_breaker.desc": "§7• §eGuard Breaker: §fHitting a blocking player disables their shield longer based on level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.harpoon": "Harpoon",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.harpoon.desc": "§7• §eHarpoon: §fForcefully pulls any creature struck by your trident toward you (up to §b20 blocks§f at level V).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.haste_continuation": "Haste Continuation",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.haste_continuation.desc": "§7• §eHaste Continuation: §fBreaking a block grants a brief burst of §eHaste§f to keep your mining momentum going.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.haste_surge": "Haste Surge",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.haste_surge.desc": "§7• §eHaste Surge: §fEvery second, has a 10% chance per level to grant Haste I for 6 seconds.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.hatred_draw": "Hatred Draw",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.hatred_draw.desc": "§7• §cHatred Draw: §fBlocking draws the hatred of all nearby monsters onto you.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.heart_resonance": "Heart Resonance",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.heart_resonance.desc": "§7• §eHeart Resonance: §fAmplifies your equipped §dElemental Heart§f and grants continuous §aRegeneration§f and §6Absorption§f when resonating.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.heartbeat_rhythm": "Heartbeat Rhythm",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.heartbeat_rhythm.desc": "§7• §eHeartbeat Rhythm: §fPeriodically emits a steady heartbeat pulse that restores a small amount of health.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.heavy_impact": "Heavy Impact",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.heavy_impact.desc": "§7• §eHeavy Impact: §fProjectiles deal §c+4§f bonus damage per level and slam struck targets forcefully backward.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.heavy_range_crossbow": "Heavy Range",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.heavy_range_crossbow.desc": "§7• §eHeavy Range: §fPropels crossbow bolts 35% faster per level and adds +2 damage/lvl (plus long-range bonus past 10 blocks).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.heavy_slow_hit": "Heavy Slow Hit",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.heavy_slow_hit.desc": "§7• §eHeavy Slow Hit: §fMelee hits inflict scaling §7Slowness§f and cut the target's upward momentum.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.heavy_wound_punch_gauntlet": "Heavy Wound Punch Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.heavy_wound_punch_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eHeavy Wound Punch Gauntlet: §fUnarmed hits deal double damage below half target health.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.high_altitude_hypoxia": "High-Altitude Hypoxia",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.high_altitude_hypoxia.desc": "§7• §eHigh-Altitude Hypoxia: §fYou take 30% less damage at high altitude (above y=100).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.high_step": "Slope Strider",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.high_step.desc": "§7• §eSlope Strider: §fAdds §a+0.45§f step height, §b+3%§f speed per level, uphill momentum, and immunity to powder-snow freezing.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.homing_trident": "Homing",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.homing_trident.desc": "§7• §eHoming: §fThrown tridents smoothly steer toward a nearby living target; radius increases by level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.horse_boots": "Horse Boots",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.horse_boots.desc": "§7• §eHorse Boots: §fEnchanted spurs: boosts your mount's gallop speed and jump height per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.hostile_boomerang_curse": "Curse of the Hostile Boomerang",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.hostile_boomerang_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the Hostile Boomerang: §fA returning trident has 12% chance per level to damage its owner.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.hundred_battles_veteran": "Veteran of a Hundred Battles",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.hundred_battles_veteran.desc": "§7• §eVeteran of a Hundred Battles: §fEach slain foe tempers your veteran grit, granting Absorption on kills and up to 20% damage reduction.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.hunters_pace": "Hunter's Pace",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.hunters_pace.desc": "§7• §eHunter's Pace: §fIncreases your movement speed while advancing toward a nearby creature below §e50%§f health.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.hydro_shock": "Hydro Shock",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.hydro_shock.desc": "§7• §eHydro Shock: §fWet, rainy or burning targets take 3% max-health bonus damage per level, with lightning chance.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.illager_commander": "Illager Commander",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.illager_commander.desc": "§7• §eIllager Commander: §fPillager attacks deal 50% less damage; Summon Army creates Illager troops.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.infernal_armor": "Infernal Armor",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.infernal_armor.desc": "§7• §eInfernal Armor: §fReduces fire and lava damage by 90% and extinguishes you.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.infernal_line": "Infernal Line",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.infernal_line.desc": "§7• §eInfernal Line: §fAllows lava fishing for Nether treasures and sizzling Cooked Cod without burning the bobber.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.inner_fear": "Inner Fear",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.inner_fear.desc": "§7• §eInner Fear: §fMelee attackers receive Weakness and Slowness for 4 seconds; level increases both amplifiers.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.instant_shot": "Instant Shot",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.instant_shot.desc": "§7• §eInstant Shot: §fFires bows at full power on a quick tap and drastically speeds up crossbow loading.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.interrupting_strike": "Interrupting Strike",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.interrupting_strike.desc": "§7• §eInterrupting Strike: §fImmediately stops the item currently being used by the struck target.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.inverted_arrows": "Inverted Arrows",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.inverted_arrows.desc": "§7• §cInverted Arrows: §fThe entire arrow volley may fire backwards.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.iron_lung": "Iron Lung",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.iron_lung.desc": "§7• §eIron Lung: §fYou cannot suffocate inside blocks.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.iron_wings": "Iron Wings",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.iron_wings.desc": "§7• §eIron Wings: §fAdds 3 armor points per level while the elytra is worn.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.item_attraction": "Item Attraction",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.item_attraction.desc": "§7• §eItem Attraction: §fWhile sneaking, instantly vacuums dropped items within 2.5 blocks per level into your inventory.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.killing_sense": "Predator's Scent",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.killing_sense.desc": "§7• §ePredator's Scent: §fStriking wounded prey (< 40% HP) marks it Glowing (6s), inflicts magic bleed, and grants you Speed II to hunt it down.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.kinetic_conversion": "Kinetic Conversion",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.kinetic_conversion.desc": "§7• §eKinetic Conversion: §fTaking a hit grants §6Absorption§f and a §e2-second§f movement speed boost scaling with level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.king": "King",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.king.desc": "§7• §eKing: §fPeriodically heals both the wearer and nearby allied players scaling with level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.last_stand_escape": "Last Stand Escape",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.last_stand_escape.desc": "§7• §eLast Stand Escape: §fBelow 25% HP, grants +25% continuous speed, clears Slowness and triggers an emergency Invisibility veil.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.last_stand_slayer": "Agony Breaker",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.last_stand_slayer.desc": "§7• §eAgony Breaker: §fShatters Absorption hearts, strips Regeneration, and deals +28% bonus damage per level to shielded targets or foes below 35% HP.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.last_stand_toughness": "Last Stand Toughness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.last_stand_toughness.desc": "§7• §eLast Stand Toughness: §fBelow 20% health, reduces incoming damage by 15% per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.leader": "Leader",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.leader.desc": "§7• §eLeader: §fWhile held in the main hand, grants §6Strength§f and §bResistance§f to you and nearby allied players.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.leap_power": "Leap Power",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.leap_power.desc": "§7• §eLeap Power: §fGrants strong §aJump Boost§f and propels you forward when jumping out of a sprint.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.leech": "Leech",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.leech.desc": "§7• §eLeech: §fLeeches §c8%§f of melee damage as health, briefly slows the target, and reduces exhaustion.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.life_block": "Life Block",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.life_block.desc": "§7• §eLife Block: §fWhen a hit would drop you below §e35%§f HP, cuts its damage by §a75%§f and heals you immediately (8s cooldown).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.light_heart": "Light Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.light_heart.desc": "§7• §eLight Heart: §fGrants §e+%s§f elemental heart(s) (regenerated in bright light), repels monsters, deals bonus undead damage, and cleanses debuffs.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.light_walker": "Light Walker",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.light_walker.desc": "§7• §eLight Walker: §fIncreases movement speed by §b+5%§f per level in lit areas (light >= 10) and prevents trampling farmland.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.lightness": "Lightness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.lightness.desc": "§7• §eLightness: §fLets you glide gently downward with zero fall damage (hold Sneak to descend at normal speed).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.lightning_calamity": "Lightning Calamity",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.lightning_calamity.desc": "§7• §cLightning Calamity: §fBeing hurt may call lightning down on your own head.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.lightning_rod_curse": "Curse of the Lightning Rod",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.lightning_rod_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the Lightning Rod: §fThrowing in rain has 8% chance per level to call lightning on the owner.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.lingering_skewer": "Lingering Skewer",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.lingering_skewer.desc": "§7• §eLingering Skewer: §fA struck target receives 2 additional damage each second for one second per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.lone_wolf": "Lone Wolf",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.lone_wolf.desc": "§7• §eLone Wolf: §fWith no allied player within 16 blocks: grants §c+15%§f damage per level (§c+12%§f at night), bonus speed, and §a-12%§f damage taken.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.loot_harvest": "Loot Harvest",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.loot_harvest.desc": "§7• §eLoot Harvest: §fEvery kill drops one additional Emerald per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.low_crit_damage": "Minor Crit Amplifier",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.low_crit_damage.desc": "§7• §eMinor Crit Amplifier: §fAll of your critical hits deal §c+12%§f bonus damage per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.low_crit_rate": "Minor Crit Rate",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.low_crit_rate.desc": "§7• §eMinor Crit Rate: §fGrants a §a5%§f chance per level to land a critical hit even while standing on the ground.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.low_damage_critical": "Minor Dive Strike",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.low_damage_critical.desc": "§7• §eMinor Dive Strike: §fFalling melee attacks gain §c+12%§f bonus damage per level plus extra scaling from fall height.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.lumberjack": "Lumberjack",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.lumberjack.desc": "§7• §eLumberjack: §fFells up to §a128 connected logs§f of a tree in a single chop and rapidly clears its leaves.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.magma_walker": "Magma Walker",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.magma_walker.desc": "§7• §eMagma Walker: §fGrants Fire Resistance and forms a temporary 3x3 Magma Block crust across lava.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.magnetic": "Magnetic",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.magnetic.desc": "§7• §eMagnetic: §fPassive magnetic field: smoothly pulls nearby dropped items within 6 blocks toward you at all times.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.marked_prey": "Marked Prey",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.marked_prey.desc": "§7• §eMarked Prey: §fHits add up to 5 marks for 5 seconds; each mark adds 6% damage per level and refreshes the timer.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.martial_rhythm": "Martial Rhythm",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.martial_rhythm.desc": "§7• §eMartial Rhythm: §fChaining melee strikes builds up to §e5 stacks§f granting §c+8%§f bonus damage per stack and Haste.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.mass_slaughter": "Mass Slaughter",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.mass_slaughter.desc": "§7• §eMass Slaughter: §fWhen at least 3 monsters are within 6 blocks, increases damage by §c+10%§f per nearby monster per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.meat_armor": "Meat Armor",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.meat_armor.desc": "§7• §eMeat Armor: §fWhile well-fed (hunger >=12), periodically regenerates up to 3 hearts of fleshy Absorption.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.mental_clarity": "Mental Clarity",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.mental_clarity.desc": "§7• §eMental Clarity: §fEvery second, shortens Nausea, Blindness and Darkness by 1 second per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.mercy_curse": "Curse of Mercy",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.mercy_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Mercy: §fThe weapon can never deal a fatal blow and leaves the target at no less than 1 HP.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.meteor": "Meteor",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.meteor.desc": "§7• §eMeteor: §fSummons a blazing sky meteor that streaks down in flames onto the arrow's impact point.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.meteor_stomp": "Meteor Stomp",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.meteor_stomp.desc": "§7• §eMeteor Stomp: §fLanding from a fall unleashes a crushing shockwave onto nearby enemies while reducing your own fall damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.mighty_strike": "Mighty Strike",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.mighty_strike.desc": "§7• §eMighty Strike: §f+1.5 melee damage and +0.35 attack knockback per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.military_shovel": "Military Shovel",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.military_shovel.desc": "§7• §eMilitary Shovel: §fGreatly speeds up digging across soft terrain and briefly stuns enemies struck in melee.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.miners_guidance": "Miner's Eye",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.miners_guidance.desc": "§7• §eMiner's Eye: §fReveals nearby ore veins using subtle color-coded guiding light rays.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.mining_stability": "Mining Stability",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.mining_stability.desc": "§7• §eMining Stability: §fStabilizes nearby sand, red sand and unsupported gravel into solid blocks.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.molten": "Molten",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.molten.desc": "§7• §eMolten: §fAutomatically smelts metallic ores (iron, gold, copper, Nether gold, ancient debris), Fortune-compatible.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.momentum": "Momentum",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.momentum.desc": "§7• §eMomentum: §fSustained grounded sprinting builds momentum, progressively granting §bSpeed§f up to the enchantment level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.monster_fishing": "Monster Fishing",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.monster_fishing.desc": "§7• §eMonster Fishing: §fSuccessful catches may pull a living aquatic creature instead of only loot.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.multishot_bow": "Fan Volley",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.multishot_bow.desc": "§7• §eFan Volley: §fFires a clean horizontal fan of §e2 extra projectiles§f per level from your bow or crossbow.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.mystic_mind": "Mystic Mind",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.mystic_mind.desc": "§7• §eMystic Mind: §fGrants 2 experience points per level every 10 seconds.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.nether_corrosion": "Nether Corrosion",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.nether_corrosion.desc": "§7• §cNether Corrosion: §fInside the Nether's furnace, this item's durability steadily corrodes over time.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.nether_curse": "Nether Curse",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.nether_curse.desc": "§7• §cNether Curse: §fReduces weapon damage by §c60%§f in the Nether, but increases it by §a+30%§f in all other dimensions.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.new_edge": "New Edge",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.new_edge.desc": "§7• §eNew Edge: §fIncreases weapon damage by §a+1%§f for every §e1%§f of durability remaining (up to §a+100%§f at full durability).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.night_veil": "Night Veil",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.night_veil.desc": "§7• §eNight Veil: §fWhile sneaking, refreshes Night Vision for 30 seconds.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.noise_disturbance": "Noise Disturbance",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.noise_disturbance.desc": "§7• §cNoise Disturbance: §fApplies Weakness for 3 seconds every second while worn.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.normal_crit_damage": "Crit Amplifier",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.normal_crit_damage.desc": "§7• §eCrit Amplifier: §fAll of your critical hits deal §c+25%§f bonus damage per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ocean_current": "Ocean Current",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ocean_current.desc": "§7• §eOcean Current: §fBoosts thrown trident speed by §b+30%§f per level in water or rain and deals §b+2.5§f piercing damage per level to wet foes.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.oceans_blessing": "Ocean's Blessing",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.oceans_blessing.desc": "§7• §eOcean's Blessing: §fWhile in water, incoming damage is reduced by 40%.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ore_detector": "Ore Detector",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ore_detector.desc": "§7• §eOre Detector: §fRight-click with a Nether Star in hand to count nearby ores.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.overcharge": "Overcharge",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.overcharge.desc": "§7• §eOvercharge: §fCritical hits unleash chain lightning arcs to nearby foes (amplified in thunderstorms or with Electric Heart).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.overclocked_crit": "Overclocked Crit",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.overclocked_crit.desc": "§7• §eOverclocked Crit: §fIncreases the damage of all your critical hits by §b+75%§f per level in a burst of cyan sparks.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.overworld_curse": "Overworld Curse",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.overworld_curse.desc": "§7• §cOverworld Curse: §fReduces weapon damage by §c60%§f in the Overworld, but increases it by §a+30%§f in the Nether and the End.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.oxygen_hover": "Air Hover",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.oxygen_hover.desc": "§7• §eAir Hover: §fHolding Sneak mid-air zeroes your vertical velocity, suspending you at a fixed height.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.oxygen_lack_haste": "Hypoxia Haste",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.oxygen_lack_haste.desc": "§7• §eHypoxia Haste: §fUnderwater, while holding breath, or deep underground (below Y=16), grants §eHaste§f and bonus speed.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.oxygen_sprint": "Oxygen Sprint",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.oxygen_sprint.desc": "§7• §eOxygen Sprint: §fBoosts sprinting speed while at full air and accelerates swimming propulsion underwater.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.pain_devour": "Pain Devour",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.pain_devour.desc": "§7• §ePain Devour: §fTaking damage restores 2 hunger points per level, up to a full hunger bar.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.panic_escape": "Panic Escape",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.panic_escape.desc": "§7• §ePanic Escape: §fTaking a hit immediately triggers a 2.5-second burst of Speed.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.pebblekin": "Pebblekin",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.pebblekin.desc": "§7• §ePebblekin: §fEnder pearl teleports no longer hurt you.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.peerless": "Peerless",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.peerless.desc": "§7• §ePeerless: §fAdds §c+4§f flat damage per level, then increases your total melee damage by §c+50%§f per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.perception": "Omniscient Perception",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.perception.desc": "§7• §eOmniscient Perception: §fHighlights all creatures within §b24 blocks§f with Glowing every §e2 seconds§f, day or night.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.peregrine": "Peregrine",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.peregrine.desc": "§7• §ePeregrine: §fIf the target is below you, adds 0.5 damage per vertical block per level, counting up to 20 blocks.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.perfect_parry": "Perfect Parry",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.perfect_parry.desc": "§7• §ePerfect Parry: §fRaising the shield just before impact strongly slows and pushes the attacker away.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.phantom_bee_vex_aversion": "Pest Aversion",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.phantom_bee_vex_aversion.desc": "§7• §ePest Aversion: §fAutomatically repels approaching Phantoms, Bees, Vexes, Silverfish, and Endermites.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.phantom_step": "Phantom Step",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.phantom_step.desc": "§7• §ePhantom Step: §fAfter 4 seconds without attacking, sneaking grants §5Invisibility§f and makes nearby monsters lose sight of you.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.phasing": "Phasing Bolts",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.phasing.desc": "§7• §ePhasing Bolts: §fYour arrows and bolts ignore gravity and phase straight through walls and entities before vanishing after 30s.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.phoenix": "Phoenix",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.phoenix.desc": "§7• §ePhoenix: §fUpon taking lethal damage, revives you to §a100%§f HP in a purifying fiery blast, consuming this enchantment.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.pierce": "Astral Pierce",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.pierce.desc": "§7• §eAstral Pierce: §fArrows and bolts pierce through §b1 entity or thin wall§f per level before stopping (exclusive with vanilla Piercing).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.pivot": "Pivot",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.pivot.desc": "§7• §ePivot: §fReversing movement direction sharply on the ground grants a brief burst of speed.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.plunder_wealth": "Plunder Wealth",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.plunder_wealth.desc": "§7• §ePlunder Wealth: §fDefeating Pillagers, Illagers, or Villagers drops bonus §aEmeralds§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.point_shoot": "Point-Blank Shot",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.point_shoot.desc": "§7• §ePoint-Blank Shot: §fEliminates shot spread and deals §c+30%§f bonus damage per level to targets within §e10 blocks§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.poison_arrow": "Poison Arrow",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.poison_arrow.desc": "§7• §ePoison Arrow: §fCreates a short poison cloud at the impact point.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.poison_fang": "Poison Fang",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.poison_fang.desc": "§7• §ePoison Fang: §fEvery melee hit applies Poison; duration is 3 seconds plus 2 seconds per level, up to Poison II.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.poison_scar": "Poison Scar",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.poison_scar.desc": "§7• §ePoison Scar: §fPoisons struck foes; hitting an already poisoned target triggers bonus toxic rupture damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.powerful_thorns": "Powerful Thorns",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.powerful_thorns.desc": "§7• §ePowerful Thorns: §fAttackers take heavy reflected damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.predator": "Stealth Ambush",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.predator.desc": "§7• §eStealth Ambush: §fStriking from behind, while sneaking or invisible, or against an unaware target deals §c+28%§f bonus damage per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.priests_blessing": "Priest's Blessing",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.priests_blessing.desc": "§7• §ePriest's Blessing: §fEvery second, removes Poison, Wither, Weakness and Slowness.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.projectile_protection_enhancement": "Projectile Protection Enhancement",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.projectile_protection_enhancement.desc": "§7• §eProjectile Protection Enhancement: §fReduces projectile damage by 12% per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.promising_blade": "Promising Blade",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.promising_blade.desc": "§7• §ePromising Blade: §fDeals §c+15%§f bonus damage per level against sturdy creatures with at least §e20 max HP§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.prospecting": "Prospecting",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.prospecting.desc": "§7• §eProspecting: §fAfter mining enough non-ore blocks, the next ore can yield one additional ore block.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.pulling_power": "Pulling Power",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.pulling_power.desc": "§7• §ePulling Power: §fReeling in yanks the hooked target (and any mount it rides) strongly toward you, up to §b20 blocks§f at level V.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.punching_armor": "Punching Armor",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.punching_armor.desc": "§7• §ePunching Armor: §fAttackers are knocked back when they hit you.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.quicksand_curse": "Curse of Quicksand",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.quicksand_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Quicksand: §fStrongly slows movement on sand, red sand, gravel, dirt and mud.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.radiant_ward": "Radiant Ward",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.radiant_ward.desc": "§7• §eRadiant Ward: §fGrants a §e15%§f chance to completely negate an incoming hit and periodically cleanses negative effects (helmet only).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.rain_nourishment": "Rain Nourishment",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.rain_nourishment.desc": "§7• §eRain Nourishment: §fWhile raining, heals 1 HP per level every 3 seconds.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.range_foot_placement": "Aerial Cushion Step",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.range_foot_placement.desc": "§7• §eAerial Cushion Step: §fWhen falling more than 3 blocks, materializes a brief cloud-cushioned invisible barrier under your feet to arrest the fall, vanishing automatically 4 blocks behind you.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ranger": "Ranger",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ranger.desc": "§7• §eRanger: §fWhile aiming a bow or crossbow, grants Speed based on enchantment level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.rapid_drop_stop": "Rapid Drop Stop",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.rapid_drop_stop.desc": "§7• §eRapid Drop Stop: §fHolding Sneak mid-air dives faster, then air-brakes right before touching the ground to soften landing.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.recoil_launch": "Recoil Launch",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.recoil_launch.desc": "§7• §eRecoil Launch: §fEach shot pushes the shooter in the opposite direction based on level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.recycle": "Recycle",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.recycle.desc": "§7• §eRecycle: §fBreaking blocks may recover an Iron Ingot.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.red_strike_gauntlet": "Red Strike Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.red_strike_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eRed Strike Gauntlet: §fEmpty-handed punches deal §c+50%§f bonus damage per level against unarmored targets.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.reinforced_sharpness": "Reinforced Sharpness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.reinforced_sharpness.desc": "§7• §eReinforced Sharpness: §fAdds §c+2§f flat melee damage per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.reinforced_sweeping": "Reinforced Sweeping",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.reinforced_sweeping.desc": "§7• §eReinforced Sweeping: §fCharged swings unleash a wide §e3.5-block§f cleave dealing §c48% + 12%/lvl§f damage and knocking foes back.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.reliability": "Reliability",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.reliability.desc": "§7• §eReliability: §fFished damageable items arrive with at least 60/90% durability.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.replanting": "Replanting",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.replanting.desc": "§7• §eReplanting: §fHarvesting a mature crop automatically replants it by consuming a compatible seed.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.resistance_burst": "Resistance Burst",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.resistance_burst.desc": "§7• §eResistance Burst: §fWhen hit, has a 10% chance per level to grant Resistance for 3 seconds.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.resistance_sustain": "Sustained Resistance",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.resistance_sustain.desc": "§7• §eSustained Resistance: §fResistance effects on you last longer.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.resonance_curse": "Curse of Resonance",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.resonance_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Resonance: §fEvery shield block emits an ominous chime that draws nearby monsters and amplifies the next hit taken.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.retaliation": "Retaliation",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.retaliation.desc": "§7• §eRetaliation: §fFor 5 seconds after being hit, the next strike against that attacker deals 20% extra damage per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.retrieval": "Retrieval",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.retrieval.desc": "§7• §eRetrieval: §fShots have a 10% chance per level to refund an arrow. Incompatible with Infinity.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ricochet": "Ricochet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ricochet.desc": "§7• §eRicochet: §fOn hitting an entity, the arrow chain-ricochets to one additional nearby enemy per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.riptide_curse": "Riptide Curse",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.riptide_curse.desc": "§7• §cRiptide Curse: §fGrants blazing swim speed and Water Breathing, but you take §c+25%§f extra damage whenever out of water (leggings).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.rock_breaking_gauntlet": "Rock Breaking Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.rock_breaking_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eRock Breaking Gauntlet: §fWhile empty-handed, your punches break up to §e6 connected§f stone blocks at once.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.rocket_blast": "Rocket Blast",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.rocket_blast.desc": "§7• §eRocket Blast: §fUsing a firework rocket while gliding adds an immediate thrust burst and knocks nearby creatures back.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.salamanders_vow": "Salamander's Vow",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.salamanders_vow.desc": "§7• §eSalamander's Vow: §fWhile on fire, regenerates health and boosts damage by §6+20%§f, but touching water deals steady damage to you (helmet).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scatter": "Scatter",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scatter.desc": "§7• §eScatter: §fFires a wide cone of scattered extra arrows devastating at close range.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scooping": "Scooping",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scooping.desc": "§7• §eScooping: §fSkims a 3x1x3 layer of matching soft ground with a chance to sift gold nuggets, iron nuggets or flint.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scorching_bath": "Scorching Bath",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scorching_bath.desc": "§7• §eScorching Bath: §fStanding in fire steadily heals you.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scorching_line_curse": "Curse of Scorching Line",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scorching_line_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Scorching Line: §fEach catch has 15% chance per level to ignite you, or drain air underwater.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scorching_prongs": "Scorching Prongs",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scorching_prongs.desc": "§7• §eScorching Prongs: §fThrown trident hits ignite targets for 3 seconds per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sea_pogo": "Sea Pogo",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sea_pogo.desc": "§7• §eSea Pogo: §fStriking a block while falling launches the owner upward and cancels fall distance.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.seismic_strike": "Seismic Strike",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.seismic_strike.desc": "§7• §eSeismic Strike: §fA fully charged grounded melee swing unleashes an area shockwave damaging nearby enemies.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.selective_excavation": "Selective Excavation",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.selective_excavation.desc": "§7• §eSelective Excavation: §fMines a limited nearby group of blocks exactly matching the first block.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sense": "Sense",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sense.desc": "§7• §eSense: §fMelee strikes deal §c+1§f bonus damage per level and highlight the target with §eGlowing§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.seraphs_judgment": "Seraph's Judgment",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.seraphs_judgment.desc": "§7• §eSeraph's Judgment: §fDeals §e+45%§f bonus holy damage to the undead, but §c-25%§f damage to all other creatures (weapon only).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shadow_heart": "Shadow Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shadow_heart.desc": "§7• §eShadow Heart: §fGrants §5+%s§f elemental heart(s) (regenerated at night); hits leech life and weaken foes, and taking damage can turn you briefly invisible.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shadow_hunt": "Shadow Hunt",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shadow_hunt.desc": "§7• §eShadow Hunt: §fIn light level below 7, increases melee damage by 15% per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shadow_sprint": "Shadow Sprint",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shadow_sprint.desc": "§7• §eShadow Sprint: §fIncreases sprinting speed by §b+8%§f per level in dim light or at night.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sharp_edge": "Sharp Edge",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sharp_edge.desc": "§7• §eSharp Edge: §fAdds §c+1§f melee damage per level and pierces a fraction of armor on charged swings.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sharpened_sharpness": "Sharpened Sharpness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sharpened_sharpness.desc": "§7• §eSharpened Sharpness: §fAdds damage per level, with an extra bonus against armored targets.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shelter": "Shelter",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shelter.desc": "§7• §eShelter: §fWhile sneaking, standing on the ground and not moving, refreshes Regeneration.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shield_efficiency": "Shield Efficiency",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shield_efficiency.desc": "§7• §eShield Efficiency: §fSuccessful blocks consume no shield durability.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shield_quake": "Shield Quake",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shield_quake.desc": "§7• §eShield Quake: §fBlocking unleashes a radial seismic shockwave that damages and launches all surrounding foes.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.short_reach": "Short Reach",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.short_reach.desc": "§7• §cShort Reach: §fReduces your attack and block interaction reach by §c0.45 blocks§f per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shortness_of_breath": "Shortness of Breath",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shortness_of_breath.desc": "§7• §cShortness of Breath: §fSprinting suffocates you (2 damage per second).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shovel_blade": "Shovel Blade",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shovel_blade.desc": "§7• §eShovel Blade: §fAdds §c+2§f damage and §e+8%§f attack speed per level to your shovel, unleashing a sweeping cleave on charged hits.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shovel_halberd": "Shovel Halberd",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shovel_halberd.desc": "§7• §eShovel Halberd: §fAdds §c+2.2§f damage and §b+0.45§f reach per level to your shovel (§c+25%§f bonus damage past 3.2 blocks or vs mounted foes).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shovel_heavy_hit": "Heavy Hit",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.shovel_heavy_hit.desc": "§7• §eHeavy Hit: §fAdds §c+3§f damage and heavy knockback per level to your shovel (§7-10%§f attack speed) while stunning targets.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sickle_damage": "Sickle Damage",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sickle_damage.desc": "§7• §eSickle Damage: §f+3 damage per level on hoe strikes.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sickle_slash": "Sickle Slash",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sickle_slash.desc": "§7• §eSickle Slash: §f+80% damage per level on hoe strikes.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sighing_strike": "Sighing Strike",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sighing_strike.desc": "§7• §eSighing Strike: §fAdds §c+0.5§f base damage and §d+1.5§f spectral magic damage per level while briefly slowing the target.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sincere_loyalty": "Sincere Loyalty",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sincere_loyalty.desc": "§7• §eSincere Loyalty: §fRight-clicking empty-handed recalls your active enchanted trident.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sky_conductor_curse": "Curse of the Sky Conductor",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sky_conductor_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the Sky Conductor: §fDuring thunderstorms, every 5 seconds has 3% lightning chance per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.slide": "Slide",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.slide.desc": "§7• §eSlide: §fSneaking out of a sprint launches you strongly forward in a sustained low-friction power slide that sweeps and slows enemies in your path.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.slow_heavy_weakness": "Sluggish Weakness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.slow_heavy_weakness.desc": "§7• §eSluggish Weakness: §fStacks Slowness and Weakness on each melee hit; at §e3 stacks§f, slams the target heavily downward.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sniper": "Sniper",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sniper.desc": "§7• §eSniper: §fArrows deal more damage with distance.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.snow_remover_shovel": "Snow Remover",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.snow_remover_shovel.desc": "§7• §eSnow Remover: §fClears nearby snow layers, snow blocks and powder snow in one scoop without harming builds.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.solo_combat": "Duelist's Mastery",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.solo_combat.desc": "§7• §eDuelist's Mastery: §fIn a strict 1v1 duel (no other combatant within 7 blocks): grants §c+22%§f damage dealt and §a-10%§f damage taken per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.soul_bound": "Soul Bound",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.soul_bound.desc": "§7• §eSoul Bound: §fItem remains in your inventory upon death.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.soul_reaping_sickle": "Soul Reaping Sickle",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.soul_reaping_sickle.desc": "§7• §eSoul Reaping Sickle: §fHoe kills have a §d1%§f chance per level to drop the slain creature's spawn egg.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.soul_repulsion_blast": "Soul Repulsion Blast",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.soul_repulsion_blast.desc": "§7• §eSoul Repulsion Blast: §fWhen struck, blasts nearby monsters for half of the incoming damage and knocks them back.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.soul_sacrifice_slash": "Soul Sacrifice Slash",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.soul_sacrifice_slash.desc": "§7• §eSoul Sacrifice Slash: §fSacrifice 40% of your health to add 10% of the target's max health as bonus damage.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sprint_impact": "Sprint Impact",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sprint_impact.desc": "§7• §eSprint Impact: §fStriking while sprinting deals §c+25%§f bonus damage per level and knocks the target forcefully back.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sprint_punch_gauntlet": "Sprint Punch Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sprint_punch_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eSprint Punch Gauntlet: §fUnarmed punches deal +1 damage per level while sprinting.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.steady_shot": "Zero-Gravity Shot",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.steady_shot.desc": "§7• §eZero-Gravity Shot: §fYour arrows and crossbow bolts completely ignore gravity, flying in a perfectly flat straight line.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.stealth_hunter": "Stealth Hunter",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.stealth_hunter.desc": "§7• §eStealth Hunter: §fAttacks from invisibility deal more damage; glowing targets take even more.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.steel_body": "Steel Body",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.steel_body.desc": "§7• §eSteel Body: §fReduces incoming damage by §a1%§f for each maximum HP you have above 10 hearts (capped at §a80%§f).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sticky": "Sticky",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sticky.desc": "§7• §eSticky: §fReduces knockback and velocity taken when struck by §a90%§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.stinky_feet": "Stinky Feet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.stinky_feet.desc": "§7• §eStinky Feet: §fEmits a toxic cloud every second that poisons monsters within §a3 blocks§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.stomach_pouch": "Stomach Pouch",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.stomach_pouch.desc": "§7• §eStomach Pouch: §fAdds native Armor points and grants bonus nutrition and saturation whenever you eat food.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.stonebound_roots": "Stonebound Roots",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.stonebound_roots.desc": "§7• §eStonebound Roots: §fGreatly reduces knockback and fall damage taken in exchange for §712%§f slower movement speed (leggings).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.storm_strike": "Storm Strike",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.storm_strike.desc": "§7• §eStorm Strike: §fCalls a sky lightning bolt onto the arrow's impact point, unleashing a shockwave ring in the rain.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.strafe": "Strafe",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.strafe.desc": "§7• §eStrafe: §fBoosts side-strafing speed by §b+8%§f per level and grants a chance to sidestep incoming projectiles.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.straight_punch_gauntlet": "Straight Punch Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.straight_punch_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eStraight Punch Gauntlet: §fUnarmed punches deal +3 damage per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.straight_reach_gauntlet": "Straight Reach Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.straight_reach_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eStraight Reach Gauntlet: §fWhile unarmed, extends punch reach (+1.5 blocks per level) and adds +1.5 damage per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.string_snap": "String Snap",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.string_snap.desc": "§7• §cString Snap: §fThe bowstring may snap, badly damaging the bow.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sturdy_brute": "Sturdy Brute",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sturdy_brute.desc": "§7• §eSturdy Brute: §fAdds flat melee damage scaling with your maximum health above 10 hearts.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.summon_army": "Summon Army",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.summon_army.desc": "§7• §eSummon Army: §fRight-clicking spends XP to deploy a reinforced loyal elite legion that fights by your side.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.super_stinky_feet": "Super Stinky Feet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.super_stinky_feet.desc": "§7• §eSuper Stinky Feet: §fInflicts §2Poison II§f and §7Slowness§f every second on all monsters within §a5 blocks§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.suppression_shot": "Suppression Shot",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.suppression_shot.desc": "§7• §eSuppression Shot: §fApplies Slowness and Weakness, with duration and strength based on level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.supreme_sharpness": "Supreme Sharpness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.supreme_sharpness.desc": "§7• §eSupreme Sharpness: §fAdds §c+8§f flat damage and §c+18%§f melee damage per level (instantly annihilates any target at level 100).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.surefooted": "Surefooted",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.surefooted.desc": "§7• §eSurefooted: §fAdds knockback resistance, gradually reduces accumulated fall distance, and stacks with existing movement effects.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.swap_arrow": "Swap Arrow",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.swap_arrow.desc": "§7• §eSwap Arrow: §fSwaps your position with the target hit.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sweeping_burn_slash": "Sweeping Burn Slash",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sweeping_burn_slash.desc": "§7• §eSweeping Burn Slash: §fUnleashes a searing circular slash that burns and slows enemies struck around you.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sweeping_enhancement": "Sweeping Enhancement",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sweeping_enhancement.desc": "§7• §eSweeping Enhancement: §fIncreases sword sweeping attack damage by §c+10%§f per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sweeping_fire": "Sweeping Fire",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sweeping_fire.desc": "§7• §eSweeping Fire: §fCharged melee attacks ignite nearby enemies around your target for §63 seconds§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sweeping_slash": "Sweeping Slash",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sweeping_slash.desc": "§7• §eSweeping Slash: §fUnleashes a circular slash dealing §c25% + 8%/lvl§f of your damage within §e2.5 blocks§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sweeping_strike": "Sweeping Strike",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sweeping_strike.desc": "§7• §eSweeping Strike: §fUnleashes a §e3-block§f circular strike dealing §c35% + 10%/lvl§f damage with knockback.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.swift_strike": "Swift Strike",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.swift_strike.desc": "§7• §eSwift Strike: §f+0.8 damage and +12% attack speed per level, paired with controlled Haste.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.swiftness": "Swiftness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.swiftness.desc": "§7• §eSwiftness: §fIncreases your sprinting speed by §b+6.5%§f per level with a rushing wind wake.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.teleport_arrow": "Teleport Arrow",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.teleport_arrow.desc": "§7• §eTeleport Arrow: §fYou teleport to where your arrow lands.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tempered_body": "Tempered Body",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tempered_body.desc": "§7• §eTempered Body: §fReduces all incoming damage by §a8%§f per level (plus §620%§f extra fire damage reduction).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tendon_break_gauntlet": "Tendon Break Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tendon_break_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eTendon Break Gauntlet: §fUnarmed hits cripple targets with Weakness and Slowness.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.thirsty_heart": "Thirsty Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.thirsty_heart.desc": "§7• §eThirsty Heart: §fAutomatically drains nearby water blocks around you each second and heals §a0.5 heart§f when absorbing water.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.thunder_hook": "Thunder Hook",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.thunder_hook.desc": "§7• §eThunder Hook: §fReeling a hooked creature has 12% lightning chance per level, doubled during thunderstorms.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.thundercall_pact": "Thundercall Pact",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.thundercall_pact.desc": "§7• §eThundercall Pact: §fStrongly amplifies your lightning and chain-shock effects while it is raining or thundering (weapon only).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.thunderstruck": "Thunderstruck",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.thunderstruck.desc": "§7• §eThunderstruck: §fElectrocuting arrow impact: deals +3 magic lightning damage/lvl and paralyzes the target with Slowness III.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tidal_step": "Tidal Step",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tidal_step.desc": "§7• §eTidal Step: §fIncreases your walking speed in shallow water while standing on solid ground.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tidal_ward": "Tidal Ward",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tidal_ward.desc": "§7• §eTidal Ward: §fGrants §bWater Breathing§f and steadily heals you while swimming (boots only).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tidecaller": "Tidecaller",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tidecaller.desc": "§7• §eTidecaller: §fOn block impact, conjures a temporary water source whose duration scales with level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.titan_slayer": "Titan Slayer",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.titan_slayer.desc": "§7• §eTitan Slayer: §fDeals massive bonus damage to bosses and titans (>= §e50 max HP§f) scaling with their size and current HP.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.titans_grasp": "Titan's Grasp",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.titans_grasp.desc": "§7• §eTitan's Grasp: §fBoosts melee damage by a crushing §c+35%§f in exchange for slower swing speed (weapon only).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.torch": "Torch",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.torch.desc": "§7• §eTorch: §fArrows plant a torch where they land.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.toy": "Toy",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.toy.desc": "§7• §eToy: §fFires a rapid stream (~5 arrows/s) without ammo that knocks creatures back for virtually zero damage (1 HP every 10th shot).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tracer_shot": "Tracer Shot",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tracer_shot.desc": "§7• §eTracer Shot: §fMarks hit targets with a glowing halo and lingering light trail (30–70s scaling with level).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.trailblazer": "Trailblazer",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.trailblazer.desc": "§7• §eTrailblazer: §fWhile grounded on Dirt Path, Gravel, Cobblestone, Stone Bricks or Smooth Stone, grants Speed based on enchantment level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.transfer": "Transfer",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.transfer.desc": "§7• §eTransfer: §fStruck players receive your off-hand item.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.transfer_misfortune": "Transfer Misfortune",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.transfer_misfortune.desc": "§7• §eTransfer Misfortune: §fMay transfer your Poison, Wither or Weakness to the struck target.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tree_felling": "Tree Felling",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.tree_felling.desc": "§7• §eTree Felling: §fFells a connected tree trunk of up to §a32 logs§f in a single chop.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.turbulence_curse": "Curse of Turbulence",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.turbulence_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Turbulence: §fPeriodically adds random lateral drift while gliding, stronger in storms.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.twenty_fourth_blessing": "Twenty-Fourth Blessing",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.twenty_fourth_blessing.desc": "§7• §eTwenty-Fourth Blessing: §fCuts fall damage by §a55%§f and prevents fatal falls from dropping you below §c1 heart§f, granting Regeneration.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ultra_edge": "Ultra Sharpness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.ultra_edge.desc": "§7• §eUltra Sharpness: §fAdds §c+4§f flat damage and §c+10%§f bonus melee damage per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.umbral_pact": "Umbral Pact",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.umbral_pact.desc": "§7• §eUmbral Pact: §fReduces damage taken in darkness but increases it in daylight; periodically spends slight HP for brief §5Invisibility§f (leggings).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.unbreakable": "Unbreakable",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.unbreakable.desc": "§7• §eUnbreakable: §fMakes this item completely indestructible: it never loses a single point of durability.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.undead_commander": "Undead Commander",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.undead_commander.desc": "§7• §eUndead Commander: §fZombie and Skeleton attacks deal 50% less damage; Summon Army creates undead troops.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.undead_curse": "Undead Curse",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.undead_curse.desc": "§7• §cUndead Curse: §fDeals §c-60%§f damage to the undead, but §a+50%§f bonus damage to living creatures.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.undertow": "Abyssal Undertow",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.undertow.desc": "§7• §eAbyssal Undertow: §fTrident impacts create a whirlpool current that pulls nearby creatures toward the point of impact.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.universal_trench_shovel": "Universal Trench",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.universal_trench_shovel.desc": "§7• §eUniversal Trench: §fExcavates a §e3x3x3§f volume of soft ground and light stone in one scoop at high speed.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.utility_trench_shovel": "Utility Trench",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.utility_trench_shovel.desc": "§7• §eUtility Trench: §fExcavates a §e3x1x3§f layer of soft ground and boosts shovel digging speed.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.veil": "Veil",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.veil.desc": "§7• §eVeil: §fReduces projectile and magic damage taken by §a45%§f, and all other incoming damage by §a18%§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.vein_miner": "Vein Miner",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.vein_miner.desc": "§7• §eVein Miner: §fMines the entire connected ore vein in a single swing (up to 24 ores per level).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.vital_reserve": "Vital Reserve",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.vital_reserve.desc": "§7• §eVital Reserve: §fConverts healing above maximum health into Absorption, capped at 4 HP per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.voidlings_hunger": "Voidling's Hunger",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.voidlings_hunger.desc": "§7• §cVoidling's Hunger: §fGrants strong lifesteal at night, but slowly drains your health under direct sunlight (helmet only).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wall_runner": "Wall Runner",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wall_runner.desc": "§7• §eWall Runner: §fClings to any vertical wall just like Honey Blocks: slides smoothly down walls with zero fall damage while letting you run and scramble along wall faces.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wardenspine": "Wardenspine",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wardenspine.desc": "§7• §eWardenspine: §fReflects §b2.5§f sonic thorns damage per level back at any attacker who strikes you.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.warp": "Warp",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.warp.desc": "§7• §eWarp: §fRandomly teleports the struck target.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.water_arrow": "Water Arrow",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.water_arrow.desc": "§7• §eWater Arrow: §fOn block impact, places water and blooms vegetation in a §b4-block§f radius; deals bonus damage to water-sensitive foes.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.water_heart": "Water Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.water_heart.desc": "§7• §eWater Heart: §fGrants §b+%s§f elemental heart(s) (regenerated in water) and periodically restores hunger and saturation.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.weak_force": "Weak Force",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.weak_force.desc": "§7• §cWeak Force: §fReduces arrow base damage by 25% per level, with a minimum multiplier of 25%.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.weakness_trauma": "Weakness Trauma",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.weakness_trauma.desc": "§7• §eWeakness Trauma: §fCharged melee hits inflict §7Weakness II§f and brief Slowness in a burst of sparks.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.weakness_wound": "Weakness Wound",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.weakness_wound.desc": "§7• §eWeakness Wound: §fInflicts §7Weakness§f and reduces healing received by the target by §c35%§f for §e4 seconds§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.weeding_hoe": "Weeding Hoe",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.weeding_hoe.desc": "§7• §eWeeding Hoe: §fAutomatically clears nearby tall grass, short grass, ferns and dead bushes without ever breaking grass blocks.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.whisper": "Whisper",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.whisper.desc": "§7• §eWhisper: §fYour arrows deal bonus armor-piercing damage equal to §ctwice§f the target's armor points.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wind_heart": "Wind Heart",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wind_heart.desc": "§7• §eWind Heart: §fGrants §f+%s§f elemental heart(s) (regenerated mid-air or above Y=150) and reduces projectile damage by §b15%%§f per heart.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wind_lance": "Wind Lance",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wind_lance.desc": "§7• §eWind Lance: §fTrident impacts create a strong non-destructive knockback wave.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wind_rider": "Wind Rider",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wind_rider.desc": "§7• §eWind Rider: §fIncreases elytra flight speed by 15/45/75% with a windstream trail.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.windrunner": "Windrunner",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.windrunner.desc": "§7• §eWindrunner: §fWhile sprinting under open sky, grants Speed based on level; above Y=100, the effect gains one additional amplifier.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wing_chun_gauntlet": "Wing Chun Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wing_chun_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eWing Chun Gauntlet: §fWith an empty main hand, continuously grants Haste based on enchantment level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wing_toughness_armor": "Wing Toughness Armor",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wing_toughness_armor.desc": "§7• §eWing Toughness Armor: §fReduces damage taken mid-air or while gliding by §a28%§f and grants §6Absorption§f during flight.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.winging": "Winging",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.winging.desc": "§7• §eWinging: §fAutomatically deploys usable elytra after four blocks of falling, unless sneaking or underwater.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wither_blade": "Wither Blade",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wither_blade.desc": "§7• §eWither Blade: §fDeals §c+50%§f bonus damage to Withered targets (rising to §c+125%§f if they wear armor).",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wither_edge": "Wither Edge",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wither_edge.desc": "§7• §eWither Edge: §fEvery melee hit applies Wither for 5 seconds; level increases the amplifier.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wound_crack": "Wound Crack",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wound_crack.desc": "§7• §cWound Crack: §fCracks your plating, removing §c2 Armor§f and §c1 Armor Toughness§f per level.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wraith_arrow": "Wraith Arrow",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.wraith_arrow.desc": "§7• §eWraith Arrow: §fArrows rend the target's soul, dealing §d+5%§f of its max HP as bonus damage and highlighting it with §eGlowing§f.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.zephyrs_gambit": "Zephyr's Gambit",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.zephyrs_gambit.desc": "§7• §eZephyr's Gambit: §fWhen struck by a critical hit, grants a chance to blink a short distance away like the wind (chestplate).",
      "enchantment.minecraft.aqua_affinity.desc": "§7• §eAqua Affinity: §fLets you mine underwater at normal speed.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.bane_of_arthropods.desc": "§7• §eBane of Arthropods: §fIncreased damage against spiders and insects.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.binding_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Binding: §fThe armor cannot be removed once equipped.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.blast_protection.desc": "§7• §eBlast Protection: §fGreatly reduces explosion damage.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.channeling.desc": "§7• §eChanneling: §fSummons lightning on the target during thunderstorms.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.depth_strider.desc": "§7• §eDepth Strider: §fIncreases movement speed in water.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.efficiency.desc": "§7• §eEfficiency: §fGreatly increases mining speed.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.feather_falling.desc": "§7• §eFeather Falling: §fConsiderably reduces fall damage.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.fire_aspect.desc": "§7• §eFire Aspect: §fSets the target on fire when struck.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.fire_protection.desc": "§7• §eFire Protection: §fReduces fire and lava damage.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.flame.desc": "§7• §eFlame: §fArrows are set ablaze and burn the target.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.fortune.desc": "§7• §eFortune: §fIncreases resources mined from ore veins.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.frost_walker.desc": "§7• §eFrost Walker: §fFreezes water under your feet into frosted ice.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.impaling.desc": "§7• §eImpaling: §fIncreased damage against aquatic creatures.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.infinity.desc": "§7• §eInfinity: §fShoots unlimited arrows as long as one arrow is in your inventory.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.knockback.desc": "§7• §eKnockback: §fKnocks the enemy back further when struck.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.looting.desc": "§7• §eLooting: §fGreatly increases loot from slain creatures.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.loyalty.desc": "§7• §eLoyalty: §fThe trident returns to your hand after being thrown.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.luck_of_the_sea.desc": "§7• §eLuck of the Sea: §fIncreases the odds of fishing rare treasures.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.lure.desc": "§7• §eLure: §fReduces the wait before a fish bites.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.mending.desc": "§7• §eMending: §fUses collected experience to repair the item.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.multishot.desc": "§7• §eMultishot: §fFires three projectiles for the cost of one.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.piercing.desc": "§7• §ePiercing: §fArrows pass through several consecutive targets.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.power.desc": "§7• §ePower: §fSignificantly increases arrow damage.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.projectile_protection.desc": "§7• §eProjectile Protection: §fReduces damage from arrows and projectiles.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.protection.desc": "§7• §eProtection: §fReduces damage taken from all combat sources.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.punch.desc": "§7• §ePunch: §fKnocks back targets hit by arrows.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.quick_charge.desc": "§7• §eQuick Charge: §fReduces crossbow draw time.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.respiration.desc": "§7• §eRespiration: §fExtends underwater breathing time.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.riptide.desc": "§7• §eRiptide: §fPropels you with the trident in water or rain.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.sharpness.desc": "§7• §eSharpness: §fIncreases melee damage against all creatures.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.silk_touch.desc": "§7• §eSilk Touch: §fLets you recover blocks intact when mining.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.smite.desc": "§7• §eSmite: §fIncreased damage against the undead.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.soul_speed.desc": "§7• §eSoul Speed: §fIncreases walking speed on soul sand.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.sweeping_edge.desc": "§7• §eSweeping Edge: §fIncreases the damage of sweeping attacks.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.swift_sneak.desc": "§7• §eSwift Sneak: §fIncreases movement speed while sneaking.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.thorns.desc": "§7• §eThorns: §fDeals damage back to melee attackers.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.unbreaking.desc": "§7• §eUnbreaking: §fThe item resists wear and tear far better.",
      "enchantment.minecraft.vanishing_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Vanishing: §fThe item disappears forever when you die.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.abyss_curse": "Curse of the Abyss",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.abyss_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the Abyss: §fEvery fishing catch has a level-scaling chance to pull up a hostile §cDrowned§f or §cGuardian§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.adaptive_shell": "Adaptive Shell",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.adaptive_shell.desc": "§7• §eAdaptive Shell: §fRepeated hits from the same damage type progressively reduce that damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.adrenaline": "Adrenaline",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.adrenaline.desc": "§7• §eAdrenaline: §fBelow 40% health, grants emergency Speed and Resistance.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.advanced_sharpness": "Advanced Sharpness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.advanced_sharpness.desc": "§7• §eAdvanced Sharpness: §fAdds §c+3§f flat damage and §c+8%§f bonus melee damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.aerodynamic": "Aerodynamic",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.aerodynamic.desc": "§7• §eAerodynamic: §fWhile gliding, reduces drag and preserves more speed per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.air_brake": "Air Brake",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.air_brake.desc": "§7• §eAir Brake: §fSneaking while gliding quickly reduces horizontal and vertical speed.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.amphibious": "Amphibious",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.amphibious.desc": "§7• §eAmphibious: §fGrants Water Breathing and Dolphin's Grace while swimming.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.anchoring": "Anchoring",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.anchoring.desc": "§7• §eAnchoring: §fSneaking reduces horizontal speed but increases knockback resistance.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.anglers_blessing": "Angler's Blessing",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.anglers_blessing.desc": "§7• §eAngler's Blessing: §fGrants a §a12%§f chance per level to double edible fish caught while restoring hunger and granting §aLuck I§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.annihilating_sweep": "Annihilating Sweep",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.annihilating_sweep.desc": "§7• §eAnnihilating Sweep: §fCharged melee swings unleash a wide shockwave dealing §c100%§f of your full damage to all nearby enemies.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.armor_damage": "Armor Damage",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.armor_damage.desc": "§7• §cArmor Damage: §fEvery hit taken inflicts steady extra durability wear on your armor.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.armor_pry": "Armor Pry",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.armor_pry.desc": "§7• §eArmor Pry: §f+15% damage per level against armored targets.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.armor_shatter": "Armor Shatter",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.armor_shatter.desc": "§7• §cArmor Shatter: §fIncoming hits have a chance to violently crack 8% of your armor's max durability at once.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.army_summon": "Army Summon",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.army_summon.desc": "§7• §eArmy Summon: §fRight-clicking spends a small amount of XP to call a loyal patrol that fights alongside you.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.assimilation": "Assimilation",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.assimilation.desc": "§7• §eAssimilation: §fAutomatically eats food from inventory when hungry.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.barbed_hook": "Barbed Hook",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.barbed_hook.desc": "§7• §eBarbed Hook: §fReeling a hooked living target deals 2 + 2.25 damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bash_damage": "Bash Damage",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bash_damage.desc": "§7• §eBash Damage: §fEvery frontal shield block deals 3 reflected damage per level to the attacker.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bash_power": "Bash Power",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bash_power.desc": "§7• §eBash Power: §fBlocking a frontal attack forcefully slams the attacker back and briefly stuns them.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.basic_chrono_mending": "Basic Chrono Mending",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.basic_chrono_mending.desc": "§7• §eBasic Chrono Mending: §fAutomatically restores §a0.5%§f of max durability every §e6 seconds§f without consuming XP.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.basic_leap_power": "Basic Leap Power",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.basic_leap_power.desc": "§7• §eBasic Leap Power: §fContinuously grants §aJump Boost§f scaling with enchantment level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.basic_lightness": "Basic Lightness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.basic_lightness.desc": "§7• §eBasic Lightness: §fNoticeably slows your descent through the air and softens landing damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.basic_mending": "Basic Mending",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.basic_mending.desc": "§7• §eBasic Mending: §fGradually repairs this item whenever you collect XP orbs (§a+1§f durability per XP per level).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.basic_swiftness": "Basic Swiftness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.basic_swiftness.desc": "§7• §eBasic Swiftness: §fIncreases your movement speed by §b+3%§f per level while sprinting.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bastion_heart": "Bastion Heart",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bastion_heart.desc": "§7• §eBastion Heart: §fNear a wall, reduces incoming damage by 8% per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.battle_hardened": "Battle Hardened",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.battle_hardened.desc": "§7• §eBattle Hardened: §fIncreases weapon damage by §c+1%§f for every §e1%§f of durability missing on the item.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.battle_scarred": "Battle-Scarred",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.battle_scarred.desc": "§7• §cBattle-Scarred: §fGradually reduces weapon damage as the item loses durability.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.beheading": "Beheading",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.beheading.desc": "§7• §eBeheading: §fFully charged strikes deal +20% damage to wounded foes (<50% HP); slaying a target grants Strength and Speed for 4s.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.berserk": "Berserk",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.berserk.desc": "§7• §eBerserk: §fIncreases melee damage in proportion to your missing health.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.big_step": "Big Step",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.big_step.desc": "§7• §eBig Step: §fAutomatically steps up §a1 to 3 full blocks§f (based on level) simply by walking forward.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.big_stomach": "Big Stomach",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.big_stomach.desc": "§7• §eBig Stomach: §fGrants a §a25%§f chance to absorb over half of an incoming blow and knock the attacker sharply back.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blaze_battle": "Blaze Battle",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blaze_battle.desc": "§7• §eBlaze Battle: §fWhile you are on fire, your melee attacks deal §6+20%§f bonus damage per level and ignite the target.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blaze_repulsion_heart": "Blaze Repulsion Heart",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blaze_repulsion_heart.desc": "§7• §eBlaze Repulsion Heart: §fReflects melee damage back at attackers and sets them ablaze on contact.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blaze_sanctuary": "Blaze Sanctuary",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blaze_sanctuary.desc": "§7• §eBlaze Sanctuary: §fReduces direct fire and burning damage by 80%.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blaze_walker": "Blaze Walker",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blaze_walker.desc": "§7• §eBlaze Walker: §fGrants Fire Resistance and solidifies lava directly beneath your steps into Obsidian.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blazing_arrow": "Blazing Arrow",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blazing_arrow.desc": "§7• §eBlazing Arrow: §fSets living creatures within roughly 6 blocks of the arrow impact on fire for 4 seconds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blazing_rage": "Blazing Rage",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blazing_rage.desc": "§7• §eBlazing Rage: §fWhile burning, grants §6+12%§f melee damage, sprint speed, and Haste per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blazing_soul_sweep": "Blazing Soul Sweep",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blazing_soul_sweep.desc": "§7• §eBlazing Soul Sweep: §fSweeping attacks unleash blue soul-flames dealing magic damage and §8Wither§f to nearby enemies.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blazing_trauma": "Blazing Trauma",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blazing_trauma.desc": "§7• §eBlazing Trauma: §fMelee hits set the target on fire and inflict brief §7Weakness§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.block": "Block",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.block.desc": "§7• §eBlock: §fGrants a §a12% + 10%§f chance per level (up to §a45%§f) to completely block an incoming attack.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blood_drinker_edge": "Blood-Drinker's Edge",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blood_drinker_edge.desc": "§7• §eBlood-Drinker's Edge: §fHeavily drains health on melee hits and converts excess healing into golden §6Absorption§f hearts.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blood_edge": "Blood Edge",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blood_edge.desc": "§7• §eBlood Edge: §fHeals 10% of damage dealt per level and poisons the struck target for 5 seconds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blood_pact": "Blood Pact",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blood_pact.desc": "§7• §eBlood Pact: §fAdds §c+1§f damage per level; above 2 hearts, spends §c0.5 heart§f to deal §d+2.5§f armor-piercing magic damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blood_transfusion": "Blood Transfusion",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blood_transfusion.desc": "§7• §eBlood Transfusion: §fCancels the strike damage and heals the struck living target by 1 HP per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bloodthirst": "Bloodthirst",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bloodthirst.desc": "§7• §eBloodthirst: §fHeals you for §c8%§f of melee damage dealt per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bloodthirsty": "Bloodthirsty",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bloodthirsty.desc": "§7• §eBloodthirsty: §fHeals you for §c14%§f of melee damage dealt per level and grants §bSpeed I§f on hit.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blunt": "Blunt",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.blunt.desc": "§7• §cBlunt: §fYour strikes lose 1.5 damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bone_break_gauntlet": "Bone Break Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bone_break_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eBone Break Gauntlet: §fUnarmed punches deal +5 fracture damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bounce": "Bounce",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bounce.desc": "§7• §eBounce: §fArrows physically bounce off blocks, walls and floors up to 1 + level times.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bouncy": "Bouncy",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bouncy.desc": "§7• §eBouncy: §fBounces you upward on every landing just like landing on a Slime Block while negating fall damage (hold Sneak to stick the landing without bouncing).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bountiful_harvest": "Bountiful Harvest",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.bountiful_harvest.desc": "§7• §eBountiful Harvest: §fBreaking a mature wheat, carrot or potato crop drops one extra produce item per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.breath_heal": "Breath Heal",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.breath_heal.desc": "§7• §eBreath Heal: §fAt full air, heals 2 HP every 2 seconds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.breath_holding": "Breath Holding",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.breath_holding.desc": "§7• §eBreath Holding: §fYour air supply constantly refills underwater.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.briar_arrow": "Briar Arrow",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.briar_arrow.desc": "§7• §eBriar Arrow: §fOn block impact, temporarily grows Sweet Berry Bushes across nearby grass blocks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.brimstone": "Brimstone",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.brimstone.desc": "§7• §eBrimstone: §fTriggers a sulfurous blast on impact that ignites nearby enemies and inflicts §8Wither§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.brittle_knees": "Curse of Brittle Knees",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.brittle_knees.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Brittle Knees: §fEvery jump damages the leggings and briefly applies Slowness based on level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.brittle_wings_curse": "Curse of Brittle Wings",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.brittle_wings_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Brittle Wings: §fConsumes 1 + level elytra durability every second of flight.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.brutal": "Brutal",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.brutal.desc": "§7• §eBrutal: §fAdds §c+2.2§f damage per level (at §7-5%§f attack speed) and forcefully knocks targets back on charged swings.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.buoy": "Buoy",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.buoy.desc": "§7• §eBuoy: §fPropels you swiftly toward the water surface based on level (hold Sneak to dive freely).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.burning_heart": "Burning Heart",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.burning_heart.desc": "§7• §eBurning Heart: §fTaking a hit ignites you for §65s§f per level, immediately activating your fire-based gear bonuses.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.burrowing": "Burrowing",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.burrowing.desc": "§7• §eBurrowing: §fBores a 1x2 directional tunnel ahead through soil or stone and grants underground Night Vision.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.burst_step": "Combat Lunge",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.burst_step.desc": "§7• §eCombat Lunge: §fLanding or taking a hit propels you forward and grants §bSpeed II§f for §e2.5s§f (2–3s cooldown).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.campfire_heal": "Campfire Heal",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.campfire_heal.desc": "§7• §eCampfire Heal: §fPassively restores §a1 HP§f (0.5 heart) per level every second.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.carriers_stride": "Carrier's Stride",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.carriers_stride.desc": "§7• §eCarrier's Stride: §fIncreases your movement speed while using an item such as a raised shield, drawn bow, or food.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.cavalier": "Cavalier",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.cavalier.desc": "§7• §eCavalier: §fDeals +50% damage per level only while riding a living mount.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.cave_in_curse": "Curse of Cave-In",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.cave_in_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Cave-In: §fMining natural stone may create Gravel overhead and apply Mining Fatigue.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.chain_lightning": "Chain Lightning",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.chain_lightning.desc": "§7• §eChain Lightning: §fIn rain, impacts arc chain lightning across §b2, 3, or 5§f nearby monsters based on level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.chaos": "Chaos",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.chaos.desc": "§7• §eChaos: §fAt impact, creates a 3.5-block cloud that applies one random negative effect for 2 seconds to each target once.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.chest_tightness": "Chest Tightness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.chest_tightness.desc": "§7• §cChest Tightness: §fTaking damage has a chance to afflict you with temporary §cWeakness§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.chrono_mending": "Chrono Mending",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.chrono_mending.desc": "§7• §eChrono Mending: §fAutomatically restores §a1.5%§f of max durability per level every §e3 seconds§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.cloud_stride": "Cloud Stride",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.cloud_stride.desc": "§7• §eCloud Stride: §fAt high altitude (Y ≥ 160), weaves a temporary cloud-wreathed barrier trail beneath your feet that automatically vanishes 4 blocks behind you, leaving nothing in the world.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.cloud_walker": "Cloud Walker",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.cloud_walker.desc": "§7• §eCloud Walker: §fConjures a cloud cushion beneath your feet on every jump, granting a boosted mid-air Triple Jump (§ax2§f / §ex3.5§f / §6x5§f jump height & distance across Lvl I–III) and completely negating fall damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.combat_roll": "Combat Roll",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.combat_roll.desc": "§7• §eCombat Roll: §fFalling while moving forward automatically triggers a forward roll that sharply reduces fall damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.combo_slash": "Combo Slash",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.combo_slash.desc": "§7• §eCombo Slash: §fLanding consecutive hits within §e0.5s§f stacks §c+20%§f bonus damage per strike (up to §c+600%§f).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.commander": "Commander",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.commander.desc": "§7• §eCommander: §fChanges Summon Army into a mixed force of wolves and Iron Golems.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.composting": "Composting",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.composting.desc": "§7• §eComposting: §fBreaking a plant has a chance per level to produce Bone Meal.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.concentration": "Concentration",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.concentration.desc": "§7• §eConcentration: §fStanding still charges projectile accuracy and up to 60% additional projectile damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.conduit_heart": "Conduit Heart",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.conduit_heart.desc": "§7• §eConduit Heart: §fGrants Conduit Power while in water or rain.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.cooked_catch": "Cooked Catch",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.cooked_catch.desc": "§7• §eCooked Catch: §fCod and salmon catches also provide their cooked version.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.core_harvesting": "Core Harvesting",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.core_harvesting.desc": "§7• §eCore Harvesting: §fLets you mine and collect §dBedrock§f, §eMonster Spawners§f, and §bEnd Portal Frames§f with left-click.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.corpulent": "Corpulent",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.corpulent.desc": "§7• §eCorpulent: §fAdds §b+2 Armor§f, knockback resistance, §a-25%§f explosion damage, and out-of-combat §6Absorption§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.crash_landing": "Crash Landing",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.crash_landing.desc": "§7• §cCrash Landing: §fSlams you heavily into the ground, multiplying fall damage taken by §c2.4x§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.crippled": "Crippled",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.crippled.desc": "§7• §cCrippled: §fRemoves §c1 Armor§f and §c4%§f movement speed per level, and slows you briefly when hit.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.crit_rate": "Crit Rate",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.crit_rate.desc": "§7• §eCrit Rate: §fGrants §a+10%§f chance per level to land a critical hit even while grounded (§a100%§f at level X).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.critical_strike": "Dive Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.critical_strike.desc": "§7• §eDive Strike: §fFalling melee attacks gain §c+22%§f bonus damage per level scaling with fall height and release an impact shockwave.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.curse_of_tremor": "Curse of Tremor",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.curse_of_tremor.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Tremor: §fYour grip betrays you: 15% chance to drop your weapon on strike.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.curse_of_whispers": "Curse of Whispers",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.curse_of_whispers.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Whispers: §fEvery 10 to 150 seconds, plays 1 to 3 random hostile-mob sounds, sometimes overlapping like a fake nearby pack.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.cursed_blade": "Cursed Blade",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.cursed_blade.desc": "§7• §cCursed Blade: §fMultiplies your weapon damage by §c10x§f, but taking even §c1§f point of damage instantly drops you to 0 HP.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.damage_critical": "Meteoric Slam",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.damage_critical.desc": "§7• §eMeteoric Slam: §fAerial slam attacks gain §c+35%§f damage per level scaling with fall height and crush nearby foes with a shockwave.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.dash": "Dash",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.dash.desc": "§7• §eDash: §fStarting a sprint launches a swift forward dash with brief incoming projectile evasion.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.decapitation": "Decapitation",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.decapitation.desc": "§7• §eDecapitation: §fEach kill has a 12% chance per level (up to 60%) to sever and drop the victim's skull.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.deep_hypoxia": "Deep Hypoxia",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.deep_hypoxia.desc": "§7• §eDeep Hypoxia: §fYou take 30% less damage in the depths (below y=20).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.delay": "Delay",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.delay.desc": "§7• §eDelay: §fPlants a ticking temporal charge on impact that detonates after 1.5s without breaking blocks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.delicate_extraction": "Delicate Extraction",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.delicate_extraction.desc": "§7• §eDelicate Extraction: §fGives a 15% chance per level to additionally drop the mined block itself.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.depth_curse": "Curse of the Depths",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.depth_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the Depths: §fHolding the cursed trident underwater drags you downward and reduces air.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.desperate_kill": "Desperate Kill",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.desperate_kill.desc": "§7• §eDesperate Kill: §fAdds 0.5 damage per missing HP per level; below 30% health, also multiplies damage by +30% per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.devour": "Devour",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.devour.desc": "§7• §eDevour: §fEvery creature slain restores health, hunger, and saturation scaling with level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.diamond_glow_gauntlet": "Diamond Glow Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.diamond_glow_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eDiamond Glow Gauntlet: §fWhile empty-handed, your punches shatter up to §b16 connected§f stone blocks in a luminous flash.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.dimensional_step": "Dimensional Step",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.dimensional_step.desc": "§7• §eDimensional Step: §fIn the Overworld adds movement speed, in the Nether grants Fire Resistance, and in the End slows falling.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.disarm": "Disarm",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.disarm.desc": "§7• §eDisarm: §fGrants a chance to force a struck monster to drop its held weapon.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.divine_protection": "Divine Protection",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.divine_protection.desc": "§7• §eDivine Protection: §fReduces all incoming damage by 10% per total level across your armor, capped at 90%.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.dragons_breath_arrow": "Dragon's Breath Arrow",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.dragons_breath_arrow.desc": "§7• §eDragon's Breath Arrow: §fArrows leave a lingering breath cloud.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.dread_aura": "Dread Aura",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.dread_aura.desc": "§7• §eDread Aura: §fWeakens, pushes back, and disrupts the aggro of non-boss monsters around you.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.dredge": "Abyssal Dredge",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.dredge.desc": "§7• §eAbyssal Dredge: §fGrants a §b15%§f chance per level to haul up sunken minerals, prismarine, emeralds, or nautilus shells when fishing.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.dry_arrow": "Dry Arrow",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.dry_arrow.desc": "§7• §eDry Arrow: §fOn block impact, dries a §e4-block§f sphere: clears water and plants, parches grass into coarse dirt, and cools magma into obsidian.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.e_speed": "Electric Speed",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.e_speed.desc": "§7• §eElectric Speed: §fBoosts your sprinting speed by §b+8%§f per level in a crackle of electric sparks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.earth_bound": "Earth Bound",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.earth_bound.desc": "§7• §cEarth Bound: §fPulls you downward much faster while airborne under heavy gravity.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.echo_strike": "Echo Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.echo_strike.desc": "§7• §eEcho Strike: §fAfter 0.5 seconds, repeats 25% to 45% of the hit damage based on level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.echolocation": "Echolocation",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.echolocation.desc": "§7• §eEcholocation: §fIn darkness (light < 8), periodically emits a sonar pulse that highlights nearby creatures with Glowing.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.elastic_soles": "Spring-Coil Soles",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.elastic_soles.desc": "§7• §eSpring-Coil Soles: §fHold Sneak on the ground (0.4s) then jump to launch a high spring-coil vault; also cushions fall damage by 25%/lvl without forced bouncing.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.elemental_chain": "Elemental Chain",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.elemental_chain.desc": "§7• §eElemental Chain: §fAdapts arrows to your environment: ignites in the Nether, slows in rain or water, and inflicts Levitation in the End.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ember_step": "Ember Step",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ember_step.desc": "§7• §eEmber Step: §fWhile sprinting, leaves a short-lived trail of fire.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.empty_fist_gauntlet": "Empty Fist Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.empty_fist_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eEmpty Fist Gauntlet: §fEmpty-handed punches deal §c+50%§f bonus damage per level against armored enemies.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.end_corrosion": "End Corrosion",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.end_corrosion.desc": "§7• §cEnd Corrosion: §fInside the End's void, this item gradually disintegrates over time.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.end_curse": "Curse of the End",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.end_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the End: §fReduces weapon damage by §c60%§f in the End, but increases it by §a+30%§f in all other dimensions.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ender_hook": "Ender Hook",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ender_hook.desc": "§7• §eEnder Hook: §fReeling a hook embedded in a safe block teleports you to it, with hunger cost and cooldown.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.enemy_attractor": "Enemy Attractor",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.enemy_attractor.desc": "§7• §eEnemy Attractor: §fStruck enemies become the target of nearby mobs.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.enemy_speed_pursuit": "Enemy's Pursuit",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.enemy_speed_pursuit.desc": "§7• §cEnemy's Pursuit: §fWhile sprinting, grants §cSpeed III§f for 3s to all monsters within 8 blocks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.eternal": "Eternal",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.eternal.desc": "§7• §eEternal: §fPrevents the item from ever breaking at 0 durability, slowly repairs wear, and keeps it on death.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.evasive_footwork": "Evasive Footwork",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.evasive_footwork.desc": "§7• §eEvasive Footwork: §fWhile not sprinting, lateral movement relative to your view direction grants Speed based on enchantment level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.execute_chance": "Guillotine",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.execute_chance.desc": "§7• §eGuillotine: §fAgainst wounded foes (< 35% HP), each sword strike has a 7% chance per level to instantly execute them.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.execute_power": "Reaper's Scythe",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.execute_power.desc": "§7• §eReaper's Scythe: §fWith a hoe: executes monsters below §c10% + 5%/lvl§f HP (heavy bonus damage vs bosses), heals §a2 HP/lvl§f, and grants Haste II.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.exercise": "Exercise",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.exercise.desc": "§7• §eExercise: §fSustained sprinting restores saturation, grants §bSpeed§f, and maintains a protective §6Absorption§f heart.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.exhaustion": "Exhaustion",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.exhaustion.desc": "§7• §cExhaustion: §fWhen exhausted or low on stamina, your melee attacks deal §c50%§f less damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.experience_harvest": "Experience Harvest",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.experience_harvest.desc": "§7• §eExperience Harvest: §fKills create an additional experience orb worth 5 XP per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.experienced_fishing": "Experienced Fishing",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.experienced_fishing.desc": "§7• §eExperienced Fishing: §fIncreases experience gained from every successful fishing catch by §a+37.5%§f per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.explosion_protection": "Explosion Guard",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.explosion_protection.desc": "§7• §eExplosion Guard: §fReduces explosion damage by 20% per level, down to zero.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.explosive_return": "Explosive Return",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.explosive_return.desc": "§7• §eExplosive Return: §fWhen the trident returns near its owner it creates a knockback wave.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.extension": "Extension",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.extension.desc": "§7• §eExtension: §f+1 damage, +0.35 entity reach and +0.5 block reach per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.extracting": "Extracting",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.extracting.desc": "§7• §eExtracting: §fExtracts bonus raw ore or gems and multiplies ore XP without breaking adjacent blocks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.extreme_sharpness": "Extreme Sharpness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.extreme_sharpness.desc": "§7• §eExtreme Sharpness: §fAdds §c+5§f flat damage and §c+12%§f bonus melee damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.false_bite_curse": "Curse of False Bite",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.false_bite_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of False Bite: §f12% chance per level that a normal-looking bite yields no loot.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.farmers_hoe": "Farmer's Hoe",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.farmers_hoe.desc": "§7• §eFarmer's Hoe: §fHarvests only fully mature crops around you and automatically replants broken mature crops.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fast_eating": "Fast Eating",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fast_eating.desc": "§7• §eFast Eating: §fGreatly speeds up eating food and drinking potions based on level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fear": "Fear",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fear.desc": "§7• §cFear: §fIn darkness or underground, reduces your damage by §c25%§f (§c30%§f against bosses) and slows mining speed.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fiery_sweep": "Fiery Sweep",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fiery_sweep.desc": "§7• §eFiery Sweep: §fSweeping attacks unleash a wide arc of embers igniting nearby foes for §66s§f with bonus fire damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.final_breath": "Second Wind",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.final_breath.desc": "§7• §eSecond Wind: §fDropping below §e25%§f HP cleanses Poison and Wither and grants §64 + 2/lvl§f Absorption HP plus Resistance II (45s cooldown).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fire_devour": "Fire Devour",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fire_devour.desc": "§7• §eFire Devour: §fWhenever you catch fire, immediately extinguishes the flames and restores §a1 hunger point§f per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fire_protection_enhancement": "Fire Protection Enhancement",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fire_protection_enhancement.desc": "§7• §eFire Protection Enhancement: §fReduces fire damage by 12% per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fire_shell": "Fire Shell",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fire_shell.desc": "§7• §eFire Shell: §fWhile burning, you take 25% less damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fishing_grapple": "Grappling Hook",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fishing_grapple.desc": "§7• §eGrappling Hook: §fReeling a hook embedded in a block pulls you toward it with increased range and force per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.flint_heart": "Flint Heart",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.flint_heart.desc": "§7• §eFlint Heart: §fAdds §c+2.5§f piercing arrow damage per level at the cost of slight extra bow wear.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.flint_strike": "Flint Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.flint_strike.desc": "§7• §eFlint Strike: §fStrikes ignite the target (3s per level).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.focused_ambush": "Focused Ambush",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.focused_ambush.desc": "§7• §eFocused Ambush: §f+20% damage per level against full-health targets.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.focused_crit": "Focused Crit",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.focused_crit.desc": "§7• §eFocused Crit: §fCritical hits trigger while sneaking.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.focused_punch_gauntlet": "Focused Punch Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.focused_punch_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eFocused Punch Gauntlet: §fUnarmed hits while sneaking deal triple damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.focused_steadiness": "Focused Steadiness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.focused_steadiness.desc": "§7• §eFocused Steadiness: §fGrants Resistance while sneaking; higher levels increase its amplifier.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.food_is_heaven": "Food Is Heaven",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.food_is_heaven.desc": "§7• §eFood Is Heaven: §fYou cannot be damaged while eating or drinking a potion.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.food_power_strike": "Food Power Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.food_power_strike.desc": "§7• §eFood Power Strike: §fIncreases your melee damage in proportion to how full your hunger bar is.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.foot_placement": "Air Walk",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.foot_placement.desc": "§7• §eAir Walk: §fCreates a temporary invisible barrier trail wreathed in soft clouds beneath your feet so you can walk through mid-air; barriers automatically vanish once 4 blocks behind you (sneak to descend).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.foresight": "Foresight",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.foresight.desc": "§7• §eForesight: §fAfter 10 seconds without taking damage, reduces the next incoming hit by 20% per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fracture": "Fracture",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.fracture.desc": "§7• §cFracture: §fFalls may fracture your legs, leaving you slowed and weakened.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.frost_trail": "Frost Trail",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.frost_trail.desc": "§7• §eFrost Trail: §fTemporarily turns water beneath your steps into Frosted Ice.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.gale": "Ascending Gale",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.gale.desc": "§7• §eAscending Gale: §fPressing Sneak mid-air unleashes an updraft launching you skyward and resetting fall distance (once per jump).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.general": "General",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.general.desc": "§7• §eGeneral: §fGrants §6Strength§f and §eHaste§f to you, plus §6Strength§f and §bSpeed§f to nearby allies and summoned troops.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.giant_slayer": "Giant Slayer",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.giant_slayer.desc": "§7• §eGiant Slayer: §fDeals §c+25%§f bonus damage per level against large creatures or foes with at least §e40 max HP§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.giant_step": "Giant Step",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.giant_step.desc": "§7• §eGiant Step: §fSteps straight up tall walls simply by walking forward (§a4 to 18 blocks§f based on level) with zero fall damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.glass_bones_champion_curse": "Curse of the Glass-Boned Champion",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.glass_bones_champion_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the Glass-Boned Champion: §fWhile worn, increases all damage dealt by 25% per level, but also all damage taken by 25% per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.gluttony": "Gluttony",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.gluttony.desc": "§7• §eGluttony: §fEating grants Regeneration and Absorption; while stuffed (hunger >=16), you take 12% less damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.grapple": "Grapple",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.grapple.desc": "§7• §eGrapple: §fPropels the shooter toward the impact like a grappling hook (or pulls a struck target toward you while sneaking).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ground_skimmer": "Ground Skimmer",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ground_skimmer.desc": "§7• §eGround Skimmer: §fFlying near solid ground preserves additional speed per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.guard_breaker": "Guard Breaker",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.guard_breaker.desc": "§7• §eGuard Breaker: §fHitting a blocking player disables their shield longer based on level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.harpoon": "Harpoon",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.harpoon.desc": "§7• §eHarpoon: §fForcefully pulls any creature struck by your trident toward you (up to §b20 blocks§f at level V).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.haste_continuation": "Haste Continuation",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.haste_continuation.desc": "§7• §eHaste Continuation: §fBreaking a block grants a brief burst of §eHaste§f to keep your mining momentum going.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.haste_surge": "Haste Surge",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.haste_surge.desc": "§7• §eHaste Surge: §fEvery second, has a 10% chance per level to grant Haste I for 6 seconds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.hatred_draw": "Hatred Draw",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.hatred_draw.desc": "§7• §cHatred Draw: §fBlocking draws the hatred of all nearby monsters onto you.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.heartbeat_rhythm": "Heartbeat Rhythm",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.heartbeat_rhythm.desc": "§7• §eHeartbeat Rhythm: §fPeriodically emits a steady heartbeat pulse that restores a small amount of health.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.heavy_impact": "Heavy Impact",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.heavy_impact.desc": "§7• §eHeavy Impact: §fProjectiles deal §c+4§f bonus damage per level and slam struck targets forcefully backward.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.heavy_range_crossbow": "Heavy Range",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.heavy_range_crossbow.desc": "§7• §eHeavy Range: §fPropels crossbow bolts 35% faster per level and adds +2 damage/lvl (plus long-range bonus past 10 blocks).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.heavy_slow_hit": "Heavy Slow Hit",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.heavy_slow_hit.desc": "§7• §eHeavy Slow Hit: §fMelee hits inflict scaling §7Slowness§f and cut the target's upward momentum.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.heavy_wound_punch_gauntlet": "Heavy Wound Punch Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.heavy_wound_punch_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eHeavy Wound Punch Gauntlet: §fUnarmed hits deal double damage below half target health.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.high_altitude_hypoxia": "High-Altitude Hypoxia",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.high_altitude_hypoxia.desc": "§7• §eHigh-Altitude Hypoxia: §fYou take 30% less damage at high altitude (above y=100).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.high_step": "Slope Strider",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.high_step.desc": "§7• §eSlope Strider: §fAdds §a+0.45§f step height, §b+3%§f speed per level, uphill momentum, and immunity to powder-snow freezing.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.homing_trident": "Homing",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.homing_trident.desc": "§7• §eHoming: §fThrown tridents smoothly steer toward a nearby living target; radius increases by level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.horse_boots": "Horse Boots",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.horse_boots.desc": "§7• §eHorse Boots: §fEnchanted spurs: boosts your mount's gallop speed and jump height per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.hostile_boomerang_curse": "Curse of the Hostile Boomerang",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.hostile_boomerang_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the Hostile Boomerang: §fA returning trident has 12% chance per level to damage its owner.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.hundred_battles_veteran": "Veteran of a Hundred Battles",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.hundred_battles_veteran.desc": "§7• §eVeteran of a Hundred Battles: §fEach slain foe tempers your veteran grit, granting Absorption on kills and up to 20% damage reduction.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.hunters_pace": "Hunter's Pace",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.hunters_pace.desc": "§7• §eHunter's Pace: §fIncreases your movement speed while advancing toward a nearby creature below §e50%§f health.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.hydro_shock": "Hydro Shock",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.hydro_shock.desc": "§7• §eHydro Shock: §fWet, rainy or burning targets take 3% max-health bonus damage per level, with lightning chance.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.illager_commander": "Illager Commander",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.illager_commander.desc": "§7• §eIllager Commander: §fPillager attacks deal 50% less damage; Summon Army creates Illager troops.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.infernal_armor": "Infernal Armor",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.infernal_armor.desc": "§7• §eInfernal Armor: §fReduces fire and lava damage by 90% and extinguishes you.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.infernal_line": "Infernal Line",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.infernal_line.desc": "§7• §eInfernal Line: §fAllows lava fishing for Nether treasures and sizzling Cooked Cod without burning the bobber.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.inner_fear": "Inner Fear",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.inner_fear.desc": "§7• §eInner Fear: §fMelee attackers receive Weakness and Slowness for 4 seconds; level increases both amplifiers.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.instant_shot": "Instant Shot",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.instant_shot.desc": "§7• §eInstant Shot: §fFires bows at full power on a quick tap and drastically speeds up crossbow loading.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.interrupting_strike": "Interrupting Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.interrupting_strike.desc": "§7• §eInterrupting Strike: §fImmediately stops the item currently being used by the struck target.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.inverted_arrows": "Inverted Arrows",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.inverted_arrows.desc": "§7• §cInverted Arrows: §fThe entire arrow volley may fire backwards.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.iron_lung": "Iron Lung",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.iron_lung.desc": "§7• §eIron Lung: §fYou cannot suffocate inside blocks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.iron_wings": "Iron Wings",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.iron_wings.desc": "§7• §eIron Wings: §fAdds 3 armor points per level while the elytra is worn.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.item_attraction": "Item Attraction",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.item_attraction.desc": "§7• §eItem Attraction: §fWhile sneaking, instantly vacuums dropped items within 2.5 blocks per level into your inventory.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.killing_sense": "Predator's Scent",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.killing_sense.desc": "§7• §ePredator's Scent: §fStriking wounded prey (< 40% HP) marks it Glowing (6s), inflicts magic bleed, and grants you Speed II to hunt it down.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.kinetic_conversion": "Kinetic Conversion",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.kinetic_conversion.desc": "§7• §eKinetic Conversion: §fTaking a hit grants §6Absorption§f and a §e2-second§f movement speed boost scaling with level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.king": "King",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.king.desc": "§7• §eKing: §fPeriodically heals both the wearer and nearby allied players scaling with level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.last_stand_escape": "Last Stand Escape",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.last_stand_escape.desc": "§7• §eLast Stand Escape: §fBelow 25% HP, grants +25% continuous speed, clears Slowness and triggers an emergency Invisibility veil.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.last_stand_slayer": "Agony Breaker",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.last_stand_slayer.desc": "§7• §eAgony Breaker: §fShatters Absorption hearts, strips Regeneration, and deals +28% bonus damage per level to shielded targets or foes below 35% HP.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.last_stand_toughness": "Last Stand Toughness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.last_stand_toughness.desc": "§7• §eLast Stand Toughness: §fBelow 20% health, reduces incoming damage by 15% per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.leader": "Leader",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.leader.desc": "§7• §eLeader: §fWhile held in the main hand, grants §6Strength§f and §bResistance§f to you and nearby allied players.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.leap_power": "Leap Power",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.leap_power.desc": "§7• §eLeap Power: §fGrants strong §aJump Boost§f and propels you forward when jumping out of a sprint.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.leech": "Leech",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.leech.desc": "§7• §eLeech: §fLeeches §c8%§f of melee damage as health, briefly slows the target, and reduces exhaustion.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.life_block": "Life Block",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.life_block.desc": "§7• §eLife Block: §fWhen a hit would drop you below §e35%§f HP, cuts its damage by §a75%§f and heals you immediately (8s cooldown).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.light_walker": "Light Walker",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.light_walker.desc": "§7• §eLight Walker: §fIncreases movement speed by §b+5%§f per level in lit areas (light >= 10) and prevents trampling farmland.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.lightness": "Lightness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.lightness.desc": "§7• §eLightness: §fLets you glide gently downward with zero fall damage (hold Sneak to descend at normal speed).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.lightning_calamity": "Lightning Calamity",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.lightning_calamity.desc": "§7• §cLightning Calamity: §fBeing hurt may call lightning down on your own head.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.lightning_rod_curse": "Curse of the Lightning Rod",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.lightning_rod_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the Lightning Rod: §fThrowing in rain has 8% chance per level to call lightning on the owner.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.lingering_skewer": "Lingering Skewer",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.lingering_skewer.desc": "§7• §eLingering Skewer: §fA struck target receives 2 additional damage each second for one second per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.lone_wolf": "Lone Wolf",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.lone_wolf.desc": "§7• §eLone Wolf: §fWith no allied player within 16 blocks: grants §c+15%§f damage per level (§c+12%§f at night), bonus speed, and §a-12%§f damage taken.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.loot_harvest": "Loot Harvest",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.loot_harvest.desc": "§7• §eLoot Harvest: §fEvery kill drops one additional Emerald per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.low_crit_damage": "Minor Crit Amplifier",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.low_crit_damage.desc": "§7• §eMinor Crit Amplifier: §fAll of your critical hits deal §c+12%§f bonus damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.low_crit_rate": "Minor Crit Rate",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.low_crit_rate.desc": "§7• §eMinor Crit Rate: §fGrants a §a5%§f chance per level to land a critical hit even while standing on the ground.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.low_damage_critical": "Minor Dive Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.low_damage_critical.desc": "§7• §eMinor Dive Strike: §fFalling melee attacks gain §c+12%§f bonus damage per level plus extra scaling from fall height.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.lumberjack": "Lumberjack",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.lumberjack.desc": "§7• §eLumberjack: §fFells up to §a128 connected logs§f of a tree in a single chop and rapidly clears its leaves.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.magma_walker": "Magma Walker",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.magma_walker.desc": "§7• §eMagma Walker: §fGrants Fire Resistance and forms a temporary 3x3 Magma Block crust across lava.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.magnetic": "Magnetic",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.magnetic.desc": "§7• §eMagnetic: §fPassive magnetic field: smoothly pulls nearby dropped items within 6 blocks toward you at all times.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.marked_prey": "Marked Prey",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.marked_prey.desc": "§7• §eMarked Prey: §fHits add up to 5 marks for 5 seconds; each mark adds 6% damage per level and refreshes the timer.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.martial_rhythm": "Martial Rhythm",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.martial_rhythm.desc": "§7• §eMartial Rhythm: §fChaining melee strikes builds up to §e5 stacks§f granting §c+8%§f bonus damage per stack and Haste.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mass_slaughter": "Mass Slaughter",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mass_slaughter.desc": "§7• §eMass Slaughter: §fWhen at least 3 monsters are within 6 blocks, increases damage by §c+10%§f per nearby monster per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.meat_armor": "Meat Armor",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.meat_armor.desc": "§7• §eMeat Armor: §fWhile well-fed (hunger >=12), periodically regenerates up to 3 hearts of fleshy Absorption.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mental_clarity": "Mental Clarity",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mental_clarity.desc": "§7• §eMental Clarity: §fEvery second, shortens Nausea, Blindness and Darkness by 1 second per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mercy_curse": "Curse of Mercy",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mercy_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Mercy: §fThe weapon can never deal a fatal blow and leaves the target at no less than 1 HP.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.meteor": "Meteor",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.meteor.desc": "§7• §eMeteor: §fSummons a blazing sky meteor that streaks down in flames onto the arrow's impact point.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.meteor_stomp": "Meteor Stomp",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.meteor_stomp.desc": "§7• §eMeteor Stomp: §fLanding from a fall unleashes a crushing shockwave onto nearby enemies while reducing your own fall damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mighty_strike": "Mighty Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mighty_strike.desc": "§7• §eMighty Strike: §f+1.5 melee damage and +0.35 attack knockback per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.military_shovel": "Military Shovel",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.military_shovel.desc": "§7• §eMilitary Shovel: §fGreatly speeds up digging across soft terrain and briefly stuns enemies struck in melee.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.miners_guidance": "Miner's Eye",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.miners_guidance.desc": "§7• §eMiner's Eye: §fReveals nearby ore veins using subtle color-coded guiding light rays.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mining_stability": "Mining Stability",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mining_stability.desc": "§7• §eMining Stability: §fStabilizes nearby sand, red sand and unsupported gravel into solid blocks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.molten": "Molten",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.molten.desc": "§7• §eMolten: §fAutomatically smelts metallic ores (iron, gold, copper, Nether gold, ancient debris), Fortune-compatible.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.momentum": "Momentum",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.momentum.desc": "§7• §eMomentum: §fSustained grounded sprinting builds momentum, progressively granting §bSpeed§f up to the enchantment level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.monster_fishing": "Monster Fishing",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.monster_fishing.desc": "§7• §eMonster Fishing: §fSuccessful catches may pull a living aquatic creature instead of only loot.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.multishot_bow": "Fan Volley",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.multishot_bow.desc": "§7• §eFan Volley: §fFires a clean horizontal fan of §e2 extra projectiles§f per level from your bow or crossbow.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mystic_mind": "Mystic Mind",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mystic_mind.desc": "§7• §eMystic Mind: §fGrants 2 experience points per level every 10 seconds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.nether_corrosion": "Nether Corrosion",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.nether_corrosion.desc": "§7• §cNether Corrosion: §fInside the Nether's furnace, this item's durability steadily corrodes over time.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.nether_curse": "Nether Curse",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.nether_curse.desc": "§7• §cNether Curse: §fReduces weapon damage by §c60%§f in the Nether, but increases it by §a+30%§f in all other dimensions.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.new_edge": "New Edge",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.new_edge.desc": "§7• §eNew Edge: §fIncreases weapon damage by §a+1%§f for every §e1%§f of durability remaining (up to §a+100%§f at full durability).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.night_veil": "Night Veil",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.night_veil.desc": "§7• §eNight Veil: §fWhile sneaking, refreshes Night Vision for 30 seconds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.noise_disturbance": "Noise Disturbance",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.noise_disturbance.desc": "§7• §cNoise Disturbance: §fApplies Weakness for 3 seconds every second while worn.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.normal_crit_damage": "Crit Amplifier",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.normal_crit_damage.desc": "§7• §eCrit Amplifier: §fAll of your critical hits deal §c+25%§f bonus damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ocean_current": "Ocean Current",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ocean_current.desc": "§7• §eOcean Current: §fBoosts thrown trident speed by §b+30%§f per level in water or rain and deals §b+2.5§f piercing damage per level to wet foes.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oceans_blessing": "Ocean's Blessing",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oceans_blessing.desc": "§7• §eOcean's Blessing: §fWhile in water, incoming damage is reduced by 40%.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ore_detector": "Ore Detector",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ore_detector.desc": "§7• §eOre Detector: §fRight-click with a Nether Star in hand to count nearby ores.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.overclocked_crit": "Overclocked Crit",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.overclocked_crit.desc": "§7• §eOverclocked Crit: §fIncreases the damage of all your critical hits by §b+75%§f per level in a burst of cyan sparks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.overworld_curse": "Overworld Curse",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.overworld_curse.desc": "§7• §cOverworld Curse: §fReduces weapon damage by §c60%§f in the Overworld, but increases it by §a+30%§f in the Nether and the End.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oxygen_hover": "Air Hover",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oxygen_hover.desc": "§7• §eAir Hover: §fHolding Sneak mid-air zeroes your vertical velocity, suspending you at a fixed height.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oxygen_lack_haste": "Hypoxia Haste",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oxygen_lack_haste.desc": "§7• §eHypoxia Haste: §fUnderwater, while holding breath, or deep underground (below Y=16), grants §eHaste§f and bonus speed.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oxygen_sprint": "Oxygen Sprint",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oxygen_sprint.desc": "§7• §eOxygen Sprint: §fBoosts sprinting speed while at full air and accelerates swimming propulsion underwater.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pain_devour": "Pain Devour",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pain_devour.desc": "§7• §ePain Devour: §fTaking damage restores 2 hunger points per level, up to a full hunger bar.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.panic_escape": "Panic Escape",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.panic_escape.desc": "§7• §ePanic Escape: §fTaking a hit immediately triggers a 2.5-second burst of Speed.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pebblekin": "Pebblekin",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pebblekin.desc": "§7• §ePebblekin: §fEnder pearl teleports no longer hurt you.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.peerless": "Peerless",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.peerless.desc": "§7• §ePeerless: §fAdds §c+4§f flat damage per level, then increases your total melee damage by §c+50%§f per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.perception": "Omniscient Perception",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.perception.desc": "§7• §eOmniscient Perception: §fHighlights all creatures within §b24 blocks§f with Glowing every §e2 seconds§f, day or night.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.peregrine": "Peregrine",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.peregrine.desc": "§7• §ePeregrine: §fIf the target is below you, adds 0.5 damage per vertical block per level, counting up to 20 blocks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.perfect_parry": "Perfect Parry",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.perfect_parry.desc": "§7• §ePerfect Parry: §fRaising the shield just before impact strongly slows and pushes the attacker away.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.phantom_bee_vex_aversion": "Pest Aversion",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.phantom_bee_vex_aversion.desc": "§7• §ePest Aversion: §fAutomatically repels approaching Phantoms, Bees, Vexes, Silverfish, and Endermites.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.phantom_step": "Phantom Step",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.phantom_step.desc": "§7• §ePhantom Step: §fAfter 4 seconds without attacking, sneaking grants §5Invisibility§f and makes nearby monsters lose sight of you.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.phasing": "Phasing Bolts",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.phasing.desc": "§7• §ePhasing Bolts: §fYour arrows and bolts ignore gravity and phase straight through walls and entities before vanishing after 30s.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.phoenix": "Phoenix",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.phoenix.desc": "§7• §ePhoenix: §fUpon taking lethal damage, revives you to §a100%§f HP in a purifying fiery blast, consuming this enchantment.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pierce": "Astral Pierce",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pierce.desc": "§7• §eAstral Pierce: §fArrows and bolts pierce through §b1 entity or thin wall§f per level before stopping (exclusive with vanilla Piercing).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pivot": "Pivot",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pivot.desc": "§7• §ePivot: §fReversing movement direction sharply on the ground grants a brief burst of speed.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.plunder_wealth": "Plunder Wealth",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.plunder_wealth.desc": "§7• §ePlunder Wealth: §fDefeating Pillagers, Illagers, or Villagers drops bonus §aEmeralds§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.point_shoot": "Point-Blank Shot",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.point_shoot.desc": "§7• §ePoint-Blank Shot: §fEliminates shot spread and deals §c+30%§f bonus damage per level to targets within §e10 blocks§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.poison_arrow": "Poison Arrow",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.poison_arrow.desc": "§7• §ePoison Arrow: §fCreates a short poison cloud at the impact point.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.poison_fang": "Poison Fang",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.poison_fang.desc": "§7• §ePoison Fang: §fEvery melee hit applies Poison; duration is 3 seconds plus 2 seconds per level, up to Poison II.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.poison_scar": "Poison Scar",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.poison_scar.desc": "§7• §ePoison Scar: §fPoisons struck foes; hitting an already poisoned target triggers bonus toxic rupture damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.powerful_thorns": "Powerful Thorns",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.powerful_thorns.desc": "§7• §ePowerful Thorns: §fAttackers take heavy reflected damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.predator": "Stealth Ambush",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.predator.desc": "§7• §eStealth Ambush: §fStriking from behind, while sneaking or invisible, or against an unaware target deals §c+28%§f bonus damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.priests_blessing": "Priest's Blessing",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.priests_blessing.desc": "§7• §ePriest's Blessing: §fEvery second, removes Poison, Wither, Weakness and Slowness.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.projectile_protection_enhancement": "Projectile Protection Enhancement",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.projectile_protection_enhancement.desc": "§7• §eProjectile Protection Enhancement: §fReduces projectile damage by 12% per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.promising_blade": "Promising Blade",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.promising_blade.desc": "§7• §ePromising Blade: §fDeals §c+15%§f bonus damage per level against sturdy creatures with at least §e20 max HP§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.prospecting": "Prospecting",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.prospecting.desc": "§7• §eProspecting: §fAfter mining enough non-ore blocks, the next ore can yield one additional ore block.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pulling_power": "Pulling Power",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pulling_power.desc": "§7• §ePulling Power: §fReeling in yanks the hooked target (and any mount it rides) strongly toward you, up to §b20 blocks§f at level V.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.punching_armor": "Punching Armor",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.punching_armor.desc": "§7• §ePunching Armor: §fAttackers are knocked back when they hit you.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.quicksand_curse": "Curse of Quicksand",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.quicksand_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Quicksand: §fStrongly slows movement on sand, red sand, gravel, dirt and mud.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.rain_nourishment": "Rain Nourishment",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.rain_nourishment.desc": "§7• §eRain Nourishment: §fWhile raining, heals 1 HP per level every 3 seconds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.range_foot_placement": "Aerial Cushion Step",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.range_foot_placement.desc": "§7• §eAerial Cushion Step: §fWhen falling more than 3 blocks, materializes a brief cloud-cushioned invisible barrier under your feet to arrest the fall, vanishing automatically 4 blocks behind you.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ranger": "Ranger",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ranger.desc": "§7• §eRanger: §fWhile aiming a bow or crossbow, grants Speed based on enchantment level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.rapid_drop_stop": "Rapid Drop Stop",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.rapid_drop_stop.desc": "§7• §eRapid Drop Stop: §fHolding Sneak mid-air dives faster, then air-brakes right before touching the ground to soften landing.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.recoil_launch": "Recoil Launch",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.recoil_launch.desc": "§7• §eRecoil Launch: §fEach shot pushes the shooter in the opposite direction based on level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.recycle": "Recycle",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.recycle.desc": "§7• §eRecycle: §fBreaking blocks may recover an Iron Ingot.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.red_strike_gauntlet": "Red Strike Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.red_strike_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eRed Strike Gauntlet: §fEmpty-handed punches deal §c+50%§f bonus damage per level against unarmored targets.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.reinforced_sharpness": "Reinforced Sharpness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.reinforced_sharpness.desc": "§7• §eReinforced Sharpness: §fAdds §c+2§f flat melee damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.reinforced_sweeping": "Reinforced Sweeping",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.reinforced_sweeping.desc": "§7• §eReinforced Sweeping: §fCharged swings unleash a wide §e3.5-block§f cleave dealing §c48% + 12%/lvl§f damage and knocking foes back.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.reliability": "Reliability",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.reliability.desc": "§7• §eReliability: §fFished damageable items arrive with at least 60/90% durability.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.replanting": "Replanting",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.replanting.desc": "§7• §eReplanting: §fHarvesting a mature crop automatically replants it by consuming a compatible seed.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.resistance_burst": "Resistance Burst",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.resistance_burst.desc": "§7• §eResistance Burst: §fWhen hit, has a 10% chance per level to grant Resistance for 3 seconds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.resistance_sustain": "Sustained Resistance",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.resistance_sustain.desc": "§7• §eSustained Resistance: §fResistance effects on you last longer.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.resonance_curse": "Curse of Resonance",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.resonance_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Resonance: §fEvery shield block emits an ominous chime that draws nearby monsters and amplifies the next hit taken.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.retaliation": "Retaliation",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.retaliation.desc": "§7• §eRetaliation: §fFor 5 seconds after being hit, the next strike against that attacker deals 20% extra damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.retrieval": "Retrieval",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.retrieval.desc": "§7• §eRetrieval: §fShots have a 10% chance per level to refund an arrow. Incompatible with Infinity.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ricochet": "Ricochet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ricochet.desc": "§7• §eRicochet: §fOn hitting an entity, the arrow chain-ricochets to one additional nearby enemy per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.rock_breaking_gauntlet": "Rock Breaking Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.rock_breaking_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eRock Breaking Gauntlet: §fWhile empty-handed, your punches break up to §e6 connected§f stone blocks at once.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.rocket_blast": "Rocket Blast",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.rocket_blast.desc": "§7• §eRocket Blast: §fUsing a firework rocket while gliding adds an immediate thrust burst and knocks nearby creatures back.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.scatter": "Scatter",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.scatter.desc": "§7• §eScatter: §fFires a wide cone of scattered extra arrows devastating at close range.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.scooping": "Scooping",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.scooping.desc": "§7• §eScooping: §fSkims a 3x1x3 layer of matching soft ground with a chance to sift gold nuggets, iron nuggets or flint.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.scorching_bath": "Scorching Bath",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.scorching_bath.desc": "§7• §eScorching Bath: §fStanding in fire steadily heals you.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.scorching_line_curse": "Curse of Scorching Line",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.scorching_line_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Scorching Line: §fEach catch has 15% chance per level to ignite you, or drain air underwater.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.scorching_prongs": "Scorching Prongs",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.scorching_prongs.desc": "§7• §eScorching Prongs: §fThrown trident hits ignite targets for 3 seconds per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sea_pogo": "Sea Pogo",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sea_pogo.desc": "§7• §eSea Pogo: §fStriking a block while falling launches the owner upward and cancels fall distance.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.seismic_strike": "Seismic Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.seismic_strike.desc": "§7• §eSeismic Strike: §fA fully charged grounded melee swing unleashes an area shockwave damaging nearby enemies.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.selective_excavation": "Selective Excavation",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.selective_excavation.desc": "§7• §eSelective Excavation: §fMines a limited nearby group of blocks exactly matching the first block.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sense": "Sense",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sense.desc": "§7• §eSense: §fMelee strikes deal §c+1§f bonus damage per level and highlight the target with §eGlowing§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shadow_hunt": "Shadow Hunt",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shadow_hunt.desc": "§7• §eShadow Hunt: §fIn light level below 7, increases melee damage by 15% per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shadow_sprint": "Shadow Sprint",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shadow_sprint.desc": "§7• §eShadow Sprint: §fIncreases sprinting speed by §b+8%§f per level in dim light or at night.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sharp_edge": "Sharp Edge",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sharp_edge.desc": "§7• §eSharp Edge: §fAdds §c+1§f melee damage per level and pierces a fraction of armor on charged swings.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sharpened_sharpness": "Sharpened Sharpness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sharpened_sharpness.desc": "§7• §eSharpened Sharpness: §fAdds damage per level, with an extra bonus against armored targets.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shelter": "Shelter",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shelter.desc": "§7• §eShelter: §fWhile sneaking, standing on the ground and not moving, refreshes Regeneration.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shield_efficiency": "Shield Efficiency",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shield_efficiency.desc": "§7• §eShield Efficiency: §fSuccessful blocks consume no shield durability.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shield_quake": "Shield Quake",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shield_quake.desc": "§7• §eShield Quake: §fBlocking unleashes a radial seismic shockwave that damages and launches all surrounding foes.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.short_reach": "Short Reach",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.short_reach.desc": "§7• §cShort Reach: §fReduces your attack and block interaction reach by §c0.45 blocks§f per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shortness_of_breath": "Shortness of Breath",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shortness_of_breath.desc": "§7• §cShortness of Breath: §fSprinting suffocates you (2 damage per second).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shovel_blade": "Shovel Blade",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shovel_blade.desc": "§7• §eShovel Blade: §fAdds §c+2§f damage and §e+8%§f attack speed per level to your shovel, unleashing a sweeping cleave on charged hits.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shovel_halberd": "Shovel Halberd",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shovel_halberd.desc": "§7• §eShovel Halberd: §fAdds §c+2.2§f damage and §b+0.45§f reach per level to your shovel (§c+25%§f bonus damage past 3.2 blocks or vs mounted foes).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shovel_heavy_hit": "Heavy Hit",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.shovel_heavy_hit.desc": "§7• §eHeavy Hit: §fAdds §c+3§f damage and heavy knockback per level to your shovel (§7-10%§f attack speed) while stunning targets.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sickle_damage": "Sickle Damage",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sickle_damage.desc": "§7• §eSickle Damage: §f+3 damage per level on hoe strikes.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sickle_slash": "Sickle Slash",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sickle_slash.desc": "§7• §eSickle Slash: §f+80% damage per level on hoe strikes.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sighing_strike": "Sighing Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sighing_strike.desc": "§7• §eSighing Strike: §fAdds §c+0.5§f base damage and §d+1.5§f spectral magic damage per level while briefly slowing the target.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sincere_loyalty": "Sincere Loyalty",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sincere_loyalty.desc": "§7• §eSincere Loyalty: §fRight-clicking empty-handed recalls your active enchanted trident.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sky_conductor_curse": "Curse of the Sky Conductor",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sky_conductor_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of the Sky Conductor: §fDuring thunderstorms, every 5 seconds has 3% lightning chance per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.slide": "Slide",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.slide.desc": "§7• §eSlide: §fSneaking out of a sprint launches you strongly forward in a sustained low-friction power slide that sweeps and slows enemies in your path.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.slow_heavy_weakness": "Sluggish Weakness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.slow_heavy_weakness.desc": "§7• §eSluggish Weakness: §fStacks Slowness and Weakness on each melee hit; at §e3 stacks§f, slams the target heavily downward.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sniper": "Sniper",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sniper.desc": "§7• §eSniper: §fArrows deal more damage with distance.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.snow_remover_shovel": "Snow Remover",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.snow_remover_shovel.desc": "§7• §eSnow Remover: §fClears nearby snow layers, snow blocks and powder snow in one scoop without harming builds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.solo_combat": "Duelist's Mastery",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.solo_combat.desc": "§7• §eDuelist's Mastery: §fIn a strict 1v1 duel (no other combatant within 7 blocks): grants §c+22%§f damage dealt and §a-10%§f damage taken per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.soul_bound": "Soul Bound",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.soul_bound.desc": "§7• §eSoul Bound: §fItem remains in your inventory upon death.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.soul_reaping_sickle": "Soul Reaping Sickle",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.soul_reaping_sickle.desc": "§7• §eSoul Reaping Sickle: §fHoe kills have a §d1%§f chance per level to drop the slain creature's spawn egg.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.soul_repulsion_blast": "Soul Repulsion Blast",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.soul_repulsion_blast.desc": "§7• §eSoul Repulsion Blast: §fWhen struck, blasts nearby monsters for half of the incoming damage and knocks them back.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.soul_sacrifice_slash": "Soul Sacrifice Slash",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.soul_sacrifice_slash.desc": "§7• §eSoul Sacrifice Slash: §fSacrifice 40% of your health to add 10% of the target's max health as bonus damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sprint_impact": "Sprint Impact",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sprint_impact.desc": "§7• §eSprint Impact: §fStriking while sprinting deals §c+25%§f bonus damage per level and knocks the target forcefully back.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sprint_punch_gauntlet": "Sprint Punch Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sprint_punch_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eSprint Punch Gauntlet: §fUnarmed punches deal +1 damage per level while sprinting.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.steady_shot": "Zero-Gravity Shot",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.steady_shot.desc": "§7• §eZero-Gravity Shot: §fYour arrows and crossbow bolts completely ignore gravity, flying in a perfectly flat straight line.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.stealth_hunter": "Stealth Hunter",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.stealth_hunter.desc": "§7• §eStealth Hunter: §fAttacks from invisibility deal more damage; glowing targets take even more.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.steel_body": "Steel Body",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.steel_body.desc": "§7• §eSteel Body: §fReduces incoming damage by §a1%§f for each maximum HP you have above 10 hearts (capped at §a80%§f).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sticky": "Sticky",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sticky.desc": "§7• §eSticky: §fReduces knockback and velocity taken when struck by §a90%§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.stinky_feet": "Stinky Feet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.stinky_feet.desc": "§7• §eStinky Feet: §fEmits a toxic cloud every second that poisons monsters within §a3 blocks§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.stomach_pouch": "Stomach Pouch",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.stomach_pouch.desc": "§7• §eStomach Pouch: §fAdds native Armor points and grants bonus nutrition and saturation whenever you eat food.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.storm_strike": "Storm Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.storm_strike.desc": "§7• §eStorm Strike: §fCalls a sky lightning bolt onto the arrow's impact point, unleashing a shockwave ring in the rain.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.strafe": "Strafe",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.strafe.desc": "§7• §eStrafe: §fBoosts side-strafing speed by §b+8%§f per level and grants a chance to sidestep incoming projectiles.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.straight_punch_gauntlet": "Straight Punch Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.straight_punch_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eStraight Punch Gauntlet: §fUnarmed punches deal +3 damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.straight_reach_gauntlet": "Straight Reach Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.straight_reach_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eStraight Reach Gauntlet: §fWhile unarmed, extends punch reach (+1.5 blocks per level) and adds +1.5 damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.string_snap": "String Snap",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.string_snap.desc": "§7• §cString Snap: §fThe bowstring may snap, badly damaging the bow.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sturdy_brute": "Sturdy Brute",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sturdy_brute.desc": "§7• §eSturdy Brute: §fAdds flat melee damage scaling with your maximum health above 10 hearts.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.summon_army": "Summon Army",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.summon_army.desc": "§7• §eSummon Army: §fRight-clicking spends XP to deploy a reinforced loyal elite legion that fights by your side.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.super_stinky_feet": "Super Stinky Feet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.super_stinky_feet.desc": "§7• §eSuper Stinky Feet: §fInflicts §2Poison II§f and §7Slowness§f every second on all monsters within §a5 blocks§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.suppression_shot": "Suppression Shot",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.suppression_shot.desc": "§7• §eSuppression Shot: §fApplies Slowness and Weakness, with duration and strength based on level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.supreme_sharpness": "Supreme Sharpness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.supreme_sharpness.desc": "§7• §eSupreme Sharpness: §fAdds §c+8§f flat damage and §c+18%§f melee damage per level (instantly annihilates any target at level 100).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.surefooted": "Surefooted",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.surefooted.desc": "§7• §eSurefooted: §fAdds knockback resistance, gradually reduces accumulated fall distance, and stacks with existing movement effects.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.swap_arrow": "Swap Arrow",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.swap_arrow.desc": "§7• §eSwap Arrow: §fSwaps your position with the target hit.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sweeping_burn_slash": "Sweeping Burn Slash",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sweeping_burn_slash.desc": "§7• §eSweeping Burn Slash: §fUnleashes a searing circular slash that burns and slows enemies struck around you.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sweeping_enhancement": "Sweeping Enhancement",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sweeping_enhancement.desc": "§7• §eSweeping Enhancement: §fIncreases sword sweeping attack damage by §c+10%§f per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sweeping_fire": "Sweeping Fire",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sweeping_fire.desc": "§7• §eSweeping Fire: §fCharged melee attacks ignite nearby enemies around your target for §63 seconds§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sweeping_slash": "Sweeping Slash",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sweeping_slash.desc": "§7• §eSweeping Slash: §fUnleashes a circular slash dealing §c25% + 8%/lvl§f of your damage within §e2.5 blocks§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sweeping_strike": "Sweeping Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.sweeping_strike.desc": "§7• §eSweeping Strike: §fUnleashes a §e3-block§f circular strike dealing §c35% + 10%/lvl§f damage with knockback.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.swift_strike": "Swift Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.swift_strike.desc": "§7• §eSwift Strike: §f+0.8 damage and +12% attack speed per level, paired with controlled Haste.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.swiftness": "Swiftness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.swiftness.desc": "§7• §eSwiftness: §fIncreases your sprinting speed by §b+6.5%§f per level with a rushing wind wake.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.teleport_arrow": "Teleport Arrow",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.teleport_arrow.desc": "§7• §eTeleport Arrow: §fYou teleport to where your arrow lands.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.tempered_body": "Tempered Body",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.tempered_body.desc": "§7• §eTempered Body: §fReduces all incoming damage by §a8%§f per level (plus §620%§f extra fire damage reduction).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.tendon_break_gauntlet": "Tendon Break Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.tendon_break_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eTendon Break Gauntlet: §fUnarmed hits cripple targets with Weakness and Slowness.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.thirsty_heart": "Thirsty Heart",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.thirsty_heart.desc": "§7• §eThirsty Heart: §fAutomatically drains nearby water blocks around you each second and heals §a0.5 heart§f when absorbing water.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.thunder_hook": "Thunder Hook",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.thunder_hook.desc": "§7• §eThunder Hook: §fReeling a hooked creature has 12% lightning chance per level, doubled during thunderstorms.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.thunderstruck": "Thunderstruck",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.thunderstruck.desc": "§7• §eThunderstruck: §fElectrocuting arrow impact: deals +3 magic lightning damage/lvl and paralyzes the target with Slowness III.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.tidal_step": "Tidal Step",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.tidal_step.desc": "§7• §eTidal Step: §fIncreases your walking speed in shallow water while standing on solid ground.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.tidecaller": "Tidecaller",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.tidecaller.desc": "§7• §eTidecaller: §fOn block impact, conjures a temporary water source whose duration scales with level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.titan_slayer": "Titan Slayer",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.titan_slayer.desc": "§7• §eTitan Slayer: §fDeals massive bonus damage to bosses and titans (>= §e50 max HP§f) scaling with their size and current HP.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.torch": "Torch",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.torch.desc": "§7• §eTorch: §fArrows plant a torch where they land.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.toy": "Toy",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.toy.desc": "§7• §eToy: §fFires a rapid stream (~5 arrows/s) without ammo that knocks creatures back for virtually zero damage (1 HP every 10th shot).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.tracer_shot": "Tracer Shot",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.tracer_shot.desc": "§7• §eTracer Shot: §fMarks hit targets with a glowing halo and lingering light trail (30–70s scaling with level).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.trailblazer": "Trailblazer",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.trailblazer.desc": "§7• §eTrailblazer: §fWhile grounded on Dirt Path, Gravel, Cobblestone, Stone Bricks or Smooth Stone, grants Speed based on enchantment level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.transfer": "Transfer",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.transfer.desc": "§7• §eTransfer: §fStruck players receive your off-hand item.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.transfer_misfortune": "Transfer Misfortune",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.transfer_misfortune.desc": "§7• §eTransfer Misfortune: §fMay transfer your Poison, Wither or Weakness to the struck target.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.tree_felling": "Tree Felling",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.tree_felling.desc": "§7• §eTree Felling: §fFells a connected tree trunk of up to §a32 logs§f in a single chop.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.turbulence_curse": "Curse of Turbulence",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.turbulence_curse.desc": "§7• §cCurse of Turbulence: §fPeriodically adds random lateral drift while gliding, stronger in storms.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.twenty_fourth_blessing": "Twenty-Fourth Blessing",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.twenty_fourth_blessing.desc": "§7• §eTwenty-Fourth Blessing: §fCuts fall damage by §a55%§f and prevents fatal falls from dropping you below §c1 heart§f, granting Regeneration.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ultra_edge": "Ultra Sharpness",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ultra_edge.desc": "§7• §eUltra Sharpness: §fAdds §c+4§f flat damage and §c+10%§f bonus melee damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.unbreakable": "Unbreakable",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.unbreakable.desc": "§7• §eUnbreakable: §fMakes this item completely indestructible: it never loses a single point of durability.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.undead_commander": "Undead Commander",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.undead_commander.desc": "§7• §eUndead Commander: §fZombie and Skeleton attacks deal 50% less damage; Summon Army creates undead troops.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.undead_curse": "Undead Curse",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.undead_curse.desc": "§7• §cUndead Curse: §fDeals §c-60%§f damage to the undead, but §a+50%§f bonus damage to living creatures.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.undertow": "Abyssal Undertow",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.undertow.desc": "§7• §eAbyssal Undertow: §fTrident impacts create a whirlpool current that pulls nearby creatures toward the point of impact.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.universal_trench_shovel": "Universal Trench",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.universal_trench_shovel.desc": "§7• §eUniversal Trench: §fExcavates a §e3x3x3§f volume of soft ground and light stone in one scoop at high speed.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.utility_trench_shovel": "Utility Trench",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.utility_trench_shovel.desc": "§7• §eUtility Trench: §fExcavates a §e3x1x3§f layer of soft ground and boosts shovel digging speed.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.veil": "Veil",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.veil.desc": "§7• §eVeil: §fReduces projectile and magic damage taken by §a45%§f, and all other incoming damage by §a18%§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.vein_miner": "Vein Miner",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.vein_miner.desc": "§7• §eVein Miner: §fMines the entire connected ore vein in a single swing (up to 24 ores per level).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.vital_reserve": "Vital Reserve",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.vital_reserve.desc": "§7• §eVital Reserve: §fConverts healing above maximum health into Absorption, capped at 4 HP per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wall_runner": "Wall Runner",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wall_runner.desc": "§7• §eWall Runner: §fClings to any vertical wall just like Honey Blocks: slides smoothly down walls with zero fall damage while letting you run and scramble along wall faces.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wardenspine": "Wardenspine",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wardenspine.desc": "§7• §eWardenspine: §fReflects §b2.5§f sonic thorns damage per level back at any attacker who strikes you.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.warp": "Warp",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.warp.desc": "§7• §eWarp: §fRandomly teleports the struck target.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.water_arrow": "Water Arrow",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.water_arrow.desc": "§7• §eWater Arrow: §fOn block impact, places water and blooms vegetation in a §b4-block§f radius; deals bonus damage to water-sensitive foes.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.weak_force": "Weak Force",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.weak_force.desc": "§7• §cWeak Force: §fReduces arrow base damage by 25% per level, with a minimum multiplier of 25%.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.weakness_trauma": "Weakness Trauma",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.weakness_trauma.desc": "§7• §eWeakness Trauma: §fCharged melee hits inflict §7Weakness II§f and brief Slowness in a burst of sparks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.weakness_wound": "Weakness Wound",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.weakness_wound.desc": "§7• §eWeakness Wound: §fInflicts §7Weakness§f and reduces healing received by the target by §c35%§f for §e4 seconds§f.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.weeding_hoe": "Weeding Hoe",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.weeding_hoe.desc": "§7• §eWeeding Hoe: §fAutomatically clears nearby tall grass, short grass, ferns and dead bushes without ever breaking grass blocks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.whisper": "Whisper",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.whisper.desc": "§7• §eWhisper: §fYour arrows deal bonus armor-piercing damage equal to §ctwice§f the target's armor points.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wind_lance": "Wind Lance",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wind_lance.desc": "§7• §eWind Lance: §fTrident impacts create a strong non-destructive knockback wave.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wind_rider": "Wind Rider",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wind_rider.desc": "§7• §eWind Rider: §fIncreases elytra flight speed by 15/45/75% with a windstream trail.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.windrunner": "Windrunner",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.windrunner.desc": "§7• §eWindrunner: §fWhile sprinting under open sky, grants Speed based on level; above Y=100, the effect gains one additional amplifier.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wing_chun_gauntlet": "Wing Chun Gauntlet",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wing_chun_gauntlet.desc": "§7• §eWing Chun Gauntlet: §fWith an empty main hand, continuously grants Haste based on enchantment level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wing_toughness_armor": "Wing Toughness Armor",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wing_toughness_armor.desc": "§7• §eWing Toughness Armor: §fReduces damage taken mid-air or while gliding by §a28%§f and grants §6Absorption§f during flight.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.winging": "Winging",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.winging.desc": "§7• §eWinging: §fAutomatically deploys usable elytra after four blocks of falling, unless sneaking or underwater.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wither_blade": "Wither Blade",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wither_blade.desc": "§7• §eWither Blade: §fDeals §c+50%§f bonus damage to Withered targets (rising to §c+125%§f if they wear armor).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wither_edge": "Wither Edge",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wither_edge.desc": "§7• §eWither Edge: §fEvery melee hit applies Wither for 5 seconds; level increases the amplifier.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wound_crack": "Wound Crack",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wound_crack.desc": "§7• §cWound Crack: §fCracks your plating, removing §c2 Armor§f and §c1 Armor Toughness§f per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wraith_arrow": "Wraith Arrow",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.wraith_arrow.desc": "§7• §eWraith Arrow: §fArrows rend the target's soul, dealing §d+5%§f of its max HP as bonus damage and highlighting it with §eGlowing§f.",
